<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">REV- Onobasulu Translation</book>
  <para style="h">Muguba Ufulu Ulufalu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kelisohe Yonefea Muguba Ufulu Ulufalu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Muguba Ufulu Ulufalu</para>
  <para style="toc3">MUU</para>
  <para style="rem">Draft with 4 translators and Johann Alberts in 2016, 2017</para>
  <para style="rem">Advisor check Anne Stoppels with Wabele Fuga and Jack Wasele, October 2019, some afternoons Joseph Hambowali and Yobe Maibi also sat in.</para>
  <para style="rem">VE by Anne Stoppels 2020</para>
  <para style="rem">Pre Consultant check corrections with Joseph Hambowali, Felix Waibo, Jack Wasele. February 2022</para>
  <para style="rem">CC in Ukarumpa 3-11 May 2022, with Elly van Bodegraven as consultant (via Skype from the Netherlands). Consultant Checking team consisted of Freshly and Yugu Ikali, Yobe and Daeyaleme Maibi. (Yobe present as translator) Beverly Mosley and Anne Stoppels. Anne also present via Skype from the Netherlands.</para>
  <para style="rem">Together with Wabele and Osa put in corrections from CC - March 2023 in Ukarumpa</para>
  <para style="mt">Muguba Ufulu Ulufalu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kelisohe Yonefea Muguba Ufulu Ulufalu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Bugo ewe selelu fogomo, inolo noolohe keliso idele inolo woba waaleba alolu. Maumo, keliso idele inolo ili asigi ule ofelesiamo, Yesu Kelisomo ine Saminilofia ado. Fogo ami, Lomene gamanehe selesia, Lomene kinimo, e-su saminilo labeba solu. Inolo uleno Yesu Keliso E Saminilo labeba selesenaga, ilihe e woba ufulu. Keliso idele inolomo higinilu bule amohe dufa dafogomesialefia, bugo ewehe ine asigi ule ufulu kiwigaaba ufiyo hamefe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bugo ewehe besi sulu wedinale seleba ufulu dobu. Besi sulu amo kegele noolo dufia holobagaeyobafe amone iminife. Keliso idele inolo fogo ami alebailu ilihe, besi sulu amo fadaba asigilubu. Auluso, sigidubuluale idele inolo ili fadaba asigibuale. Besi sulu ewene maumo ewe. Yesu Keliso E bule alefasia, Ene sonehe, Gode alefasia, Ene gisa sunia dufa dafogofia, aufia Ehe Sedeneda dufa dafogolu. Aufia, helefealuda, anakiwida, samodofea fogo ami, sigidubulu idele inolo ine asigi ule ufulu afelesiale, kiwigaafia alebaibu, ili amofea Godehe ine elebe meyobafe. Ili Godedai ligia, higinilu diyobafale maumo, Gode alefasia kegele sunia hilisu moloba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ga bugo ewe alegasiamo, gahe <char style="it">namba</char> alegalo wedinale selelu dobi babiyobafe. Namba domoda, namba huguluda, aufia 144,000 amoda, namba amogulu babiyobafe. Amomo, namba sealeale. Aubale. Namba amomo mimisililu ligia, sulu amone sisamo kiwi koleba dobu. Nini sulu amone besisia, sisa ilugi sigabideno geba dobu. Sigabi geba dobu amone sulu ga alegasenaga, gahe mimisililu amone kiwi fadaba babiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s">Yonehe bugo ewene saaba selelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 22:6">MUU 22.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisohe</char> ulufaba walelu sulu amo ewe. Saminimo, sulu ewe muguba ufia alolu. Auluso, Godehe Yesu Kelisofea walesia, kegele E moloyo hagoalefe amone walelu. Auba walesiamo, Yesuhe kegele amo Ene dabalu mololo ilifea ulufaba homesi, aulu. Ausi, Yesuhe Ene sulu dia ano hilibaisia, sulu ewe Yone nafea saaba memesi hilibaiso. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Aufia, Yone, na-mo, Yesune dabalu mololo ligia, kegele na abulumo ulufaba saaba dafelagosia, Godene suluda, Yesu Keliso sulu solu amoda, sealeba saaba dafelagosu. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:7">MUU 22.7</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:10">10</ref></char></note>Sulu ewe, Gode alefasia saaba ufulu sulu dobu. Aufia, inolo abehe sulu ewe noolofea koleba alegafemoda, alegasi dobelefe ili amoda, ili amo sulu ewe kuliba dedalesenaga, ili amo <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">edililo</char> diyobafe. Mau enebamo, kegele Godehe moloyo solumo, fogo hagoale adefe.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-s</para>
  <para style="s">Yonehe sese domobafea sowi seleba mebailu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:14-15">Kis 3.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:1">MUU 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:5">4.5</ref></char>
    </note>Sulu ewe Yonehe <char style="w">sese</char> domoba Asia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yone bugo ewe selelu fogo ami, Lome ilihe hele </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Asia</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ami luba yasiba alolu.</char></note> helea ami waalebumofea seleba mebailu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 1:4" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:4">Labe amo E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:4">Alolu amo E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:4">Miyobafe amo E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:4">Gode amofeafiada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:4">asubane domoba<note caller="†" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Asubane domoba</char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo Godene Asubane iminife. Namba domo amo, mimisililu namba ligia, liliba samodoluba iminife. Godene Asubanemo kegele uleno abobolale koleba. </char></note> Ene kinine asefalu ailalu amone olegia labe amofeafiada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:4">Yesu Kelisofeafiada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:4">
    <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomohe</char> gine libo esebalo melesi <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> ufiyobafe.<verse eid="REV 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:18">Kol 1.18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:27">Sng 89.27</ref></char>
    </note>Sulu seale saaba dafelagolomo, Yesu Keliso amo E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:5">Daneba yaalu dobiafia degelu ili amone olaibo, amo E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:5">Helefealu kini suniane yasilo labe, amo E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:5">Yesu Ehe idele inolo nini hamesefia, olasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:5">Ene ibi sagalu amohe,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:5">ninimo nine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolufeafia</char> sububa dafelagolu.<verse eid="REV 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1Fid 2.9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:10">MUU 5.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:6">20.6</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, Ehe ninimo ene kinine mosomu melesi gadefasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:6">ulu <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melo alebaimesi</char> gadefalu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:6">Ausihe, nini Ene Enao Godene dabalu molomesi aulu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:6">Auba aulune, ninihe Ene wi eweguba wabialeyo dobu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:6">Kiwigagaluda, yane elale elaleba daaluda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:6">Efea alefalu miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:6">
    <char style="sls">
      <char style="w">Amen</char>.</char> Seale koleba auba auyobafe.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Sek 12.10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mad 24.30</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:34-37">Yon 19.34-37</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:17">1Des 4.17</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">Bama, Yesu iwa saabia alefasia saabimo, </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:7">
    <char style="qt">idele inolo suniane sihe E babiyobafe. </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:7">Eda dufa olalu ili amoda, E babiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:7">Helefealune mosomu idele inolo sunia E bisigiamo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:7">yagunagaba yegiliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:7">
    <char style="sls">Amen</char>. Seale, auba moloyobafe.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 21:6">MUU 21.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22.13</ref></char>
    </note>Labe amo E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:8">Alolu amo E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:8">Miyobafe amo E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:8">Kiwigagalu suniane wasolu amo E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:8">
    <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Gode Ehe eweguba selefe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:8">“Maugalumo, Nene Na, aufia Samodoyomo, Nene Na.”<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-e</para>
  <para style="s">Yonehe Yesu abulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Na Yone, na gine gelewodai, ganodai, ligia, nini Yesufea kulifia ligia, ua eweguba lolu. Nini ua higinilu dilo lolu. Aufia, nada, gilida, nini Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo ada amone mosomu ua lolu. Aufia, Yesufea kulifia ligia, kiwi sanefia afelesiale, nini ua lolu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:9">Nahe Godene sulu selesiamo, na Yesufea asigi ule ufulu amone walesi, mau amo alefasia, ilihe na sefia, na fisaba anosisia, lubia abia, saidudu Fademoso ami, hamagi melesi ifoba ofasia, ilimo hano sibi obegeba abia, ine ada dedaleso.<verse eid="REV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Na auba ami ligia, Saminilone hilia Domo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hilia Domo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo Saminilone hiliaba sodo. Maumo, hilia Yesu Eda degeba ifolumo, Domo hilia amo.</char></note> amimo, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane Noekene</char> nafea adesimo, na faisalo koleba wuaalu dubulu. Wuaalu amo, fuulu galaloguba galaso. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Ami wuaasiamo, eweguba seleso. “Ga besabe amo, sowi selefasia, <char style="w">sese</char> domoba amofea seleba mebaimaleso. Ga mebaisiamo, Efesafeada, Seminafeada, Fegamumufeada, Dailadailafeada, Sadisifeada, Filadefiafeada, Laodisiafeada, ili amofea seleba mebaimaleso.”<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Sulu amo selesi, nafea selefelaba babiyone nolofasia, bosolufalumo, naafa yaalo domoba golo mololu dobi abulu. <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:5">10.5</ref></char></note>Naafa yaalo aleba amimo, <char style="w">inololene faibe</char> amogulu yoba labeo. E fagulo selale siligaba kaafia, bulu golo mololu uleno ene hamesa agofa kaafia labeo. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 43:2">Ese 43.2</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7.9</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:6">10.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:18">MUU 2.18</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:12">19.12</ref></char></note>Ene guni aluda, hoolubiyo. Dofene sibi alu hoolugulubiyo, me kene hoolugulubiyo. Aufia, Ene simo, de waiyagulu neeso. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Aufia, Ene emomo, aeyene kiwi kolelu de subulu genelu neeloguba neeso. Aufia, Ene mofe sulu goomo, hano saa bule gulologuba galaso. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:12">Hib 4.12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:12">MUU 2.12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:15">19.15</ref></char></note>Ene sone ililibefealo usu amimo, sigabi domoba seba labeo. Aufia, helebesi selale uleno, nolobaloda sida, nolobaloda sida, minilu koleba ene mofeyo holobagafia labeo. Aufia, Ene olegimo, halo nee kolelu fofageba neeloguba, neeso.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:6">Ais 44.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48.12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:8">MUU 2.8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22.13</ref></char>
    </note>Nahe E bisigiamo, na sagilisia, Ene emo aniba sigibaisia, olalugulu ufulu. Aufia, Ehe Ene sone ililibemo na saabia ofelesia, nafea selesia, “Ga sagilimabu! Maugalumo, Nene Na. Aufia Samodoyomoda, Nene Na. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Aufia, Na Bebea Adomone lolu. Na samini olaluso, bama! Aga Na bebea ligia, alefalu miliyolu lolu. Aufia, Na olalone giida, daneba yaalu yasiba ada hele amone giida, Na sebu. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Aulugulu, kegele ga besabe amo, selema. Kegele aga dobu eweda, kegele dufialo moloyobafe amoda, selema. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Sigabi domobamo, gahe ne sone ililibefealo sefia labi abulu amoda, aufia, naafa yaalo golo mololu domoba labi abulu amoda, amone mugusilu Na gafea walesu. Sulu ewene muguba dobumo, mau eweguba. Naafa yaalo domoba labe amomo, sese domoba amone labe. Sigabi domoba amomo, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> domoba amone iminife. Ili domoba amo, sese domoba ule uleba uluba miliyone labe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:20">Inololene Faibe amohe nafea auba seleso.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="rem">z1col-s</para>
  <para style="s">Efesa sesefea sowi ewe seleba mebaimalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 1:16">MUU 1.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo amohe nafea saabia eweguba seleso. “Ga Efesa daunone <char style="w">sese</char> amone sulu dia ano amofea sowi seleba mesia, eweguba saama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:1" />
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 2:1">‘Sigabi domoba sone ililibefealo sefia ligia, naafa yaalo golo mololu domoba amone aleba ami siba adomo, amo Na.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 2:1">Na amo lolugulu, Na sulu ewe gafea seleba mebaisu.<verse eid="REV 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 4:1">1Yon 4.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mana sunia gili mololomoda, dabalu hogololu gili mololomoda, gili kiwi sanefia afolale mana amoda, Na hilisebu. Gilihe wolu mololo inolo amofea waaselaba bisigia, ilidai ua adalebiyo. Amoda na hilisebu. Inolo noolohe gilifea selesia, nini <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> loluba solubiyo. Auluso ili amoale. Aufia, gilihe ili dedeba bafasia, ili amo masega gegelo inolobuba eloba abulubiyo. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Inolo noolohe gili Ne wi sefia labi baafia, gili woba waalelobiyo. Ausi, gili kiwi sanefia afelesiale, higinilu amo holobagasi, hogololu dabalu amo, gili habosiale dilobiyo. Amoda, Na hilisebu.<verse eid="REV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Auluso, Na gilifea hilisesiamo, gine mana Na haboba bolomo, ewe. Gili samini Nafea bule heafuba hameselu mana amo afelesia, aga Nafea wedinosu hamesefia labe. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:3">MUU 3.3</ref></char></note>Samini gili Nafea hameseiya ami, obegeba baaba lagoma. Aga gili usulaboba hugafia labemo, gine eloba bama. Aulugulu, gili nolofia <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besima</char>. Mana nafulu maugaba gili mololo afolumo, moloba obegema. Auluso, gili auba besiba obegesalenaga, amo Na gili labea milifasia, naafa yaalo gilifea dobu ogo, Nene sagoba diyo.<verse eid="REV 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Auluso, gine mana nafulu ulenomo ewe. Gilihe mana Nikolase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mana Nikolase mosomu ilihe mololo amo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">seale halagubabi nini asigibuale. Nini bisigiamo, samini sesene guni inolo uleno e alolu besabe. (Hilibaisi Daalu 6.5 ami alegama.) Auba ausenaga, amo e koleba hodobaisia, mana wolu maugaba mololubu. Aufia, e masega godefea gulugulusia, susugu mana bule moloba yaalu. E mosomune guni inolo alolune, ene kuliba ano ilida mana wolu amogulu moloba yaalu. Dawalolo inolo noolo ilihe auba hilisefe.</char></note> mosomu ilihe mololo amo, habosia gogoloba bolobiyo. Nada ine mana ewe gogoloba bolo.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:9">Stt 2.9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:2">MUU 22.2</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:19">19</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, idele inolo konenida labe gili, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenehe</char> sese suniafea sulu selaba yaafemo, nafuluba doma.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:7" />
  <para style="pm" vid="REV 2:7">Idele inolo abehe, dedeba besabi, yobolu kaamo adesenaga, amo ilifea miliyolu melone i amofea, sebe helelebumo ene sufasia, waagi namenayobasu. Miliyolu melone i amo, Godene Faladaisi usu ami labe.’ ”<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Semina sesefea sowi ewe seleba mebaimalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />Inololene Faibe amohe nafea saabia eweguba seleso. “Ga Semina daunone <char style="w">sese</char> amone sulu dia ano amofea sowi seleba mesia, eweguba saama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:8" />
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 2:8">‘Maugalu Nene Na. Aufia, Samodoyoda Nene Na. Samini olalumo, Na. Aga haiba bebea alefasia labe amomo, Na.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 2:8">Na amo lolugulu, Na sulu ewe gafea seleba mebaisu.<verse eid="REV 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:14-15">2Kld 11.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:9">MUU 3.9</ref></char>
    </note>Gilihe higinilu noolo dilomo, Na hilisebu. Gili weagulu labe amoda, na hilisebu. Weagulu labeso, asubanefealomo, seale gili elebeda ufulu labe. Inolo noolohe gili saaba duduba sela siba labe, amoda Na hilisebu. Inolo ilihe ine meleba saaba selesiamo, nini Gode molobebelu <char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomu loluba sodo. Auluso, ili amoale. Ili <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenene</char> mosomu labe. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:8">2Dim 4.8</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:12">Yem 1.12</ref></char></note>Nagamo, ga diyo hagoale adefe amone, baaba sagilimabiyo. Doma, <char style="w">henane</char> gili dedeba babiyone, ehe gili aleba ami inolo noolomo sefasia, dibolo dafaliba ilogoyobafe. Ausi, gili nagadai, higiniludai, amo hilia daabuluba auba diyobafe. Auluso, gili gine asigi ule ufulu ogo olaeyoda, sagilisiale fedoba sefiasu abia elosimo, Nahe gilifea miliyolu miliyo kaamo alolune momada meyobasu.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Aulugulu, idele inolo konenida labe gili, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenehe</char> sese suniafea sulu selaba yaafemo, nafuluba doma.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:11" />
  <para style="pm" vid="REV 2:11">Idele inolo abehe, dedeba besabi, yobolu kaamo adesenaga, Olaeyo Aganebo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Olaeyo Aganebo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo Osolaeyo Hilia amone faisa holobagaeyobafe. Osolaeyo Hilia ami danelu sunia haiba degeyobafe. Ausi, Godehe ili sunia osolaeyobafe. Miliyolu Miliyo Bugo usu seleluale idele inolo ili amo, waiyo de waiya usulale usu ami abia, haiba aganebo olaeyobafe. (Muguba Ufulu Ulufalu 20.14 amida, 21.8 amida, alegamale.)</char></note> amohe ili woba dafiyobafale koleba.’ ”<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fegamumu sesefea sowi ewe seleba mebaimalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />Inolo ewehe nafea saabia eweguba seleso. “Ga Fegamumu daunone <char style="w">sese</char> amone sulu dia ano amofea sowi seleba mesia, eweguba saama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:12" />
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 2:12">‘Helebesi, nolobalo sida, nolobalo sida, minilu koleba amoda sefia labe amo, Na.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 2:12">Na amo lolugulu, Na sulu ewe gafea seleba mebaisu.<verse eid="REV 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Dauno gilida saabea ogomo, Na nafuluba fadaba hilisebu. <char style="w">Sedene</char> hele amifia yasifia ligia, ene asefalu ailalumo ugi dobu. Auluso, gili ami ligia, Ne wi fedoba sefia, gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> amo yuasia, eleda malesia, afolale. Saminimo, gine daunomo, Sedene ada ami, Adifase, e Ne sulu fedoba sefia, saaba dafelagoba labi, ilihe e sefia dufa olaso. Auluso, fogo amida, gilihe gine asigi ule ufulumo afelesale. Amoda, Na hilisebu.<verse eid="REV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 22:1-25:3">Nam 22.1–25.3</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 31:16">31.16</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:15">2Fid 2.15</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, Na gilifea hilisesiamo, gine mana nooloda Na haboba bolomo, ewe. Gili aleba ugi noolomo, Balamahe sulu walelumo fedoba sefia, kuliba daaba labe. Amakelemo, Balama ehe asigilomo kini Balakafea mesi, Balaka e alefasia <char style="w">Isolaele</char> idele inolo mana wolu molomesifia, kani helelubiyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isolaele mosomu ilimo hamu daabuluba biniba hele falaiya siba aloiya fogo ami, inolo </char><char style="fq">Balama </char> e, Moaba hele masega godene saaba ofolo uleno alolu. Aufia, inolo <char style="fq">Balakamo</char>, e hele Moabane kini alolu. Kini Balaka ehe Isolaele mosomumo woba dafiyosia, Balamafea ga Isolaele mosomu soaneba saamalelu. Ausi, Godehe Balama auba soaneba samesialesia, Ehe e kaalu. Auba kaafia labi bisigia, Balamahe kini Balakafea asigi no mesia selesia, “Ga Isolaele mosomu susugu molomesine seseamaleba” solu. Amone sadalumo, Namba 22.1–25.3, aufia 31.16 ami alegaba bamale.</note> Ausia, ehe Isolaele idele inolo masega godefea soba melo kelebulu amo nabia, susugu mana amoda, molomesi sesealubiyo. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Aufia, gili aleba noolomo, Nikolasehe walelumo fedoba sefia kuliba daaba labe. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Aulugulu, gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besima</char>. Gili auba ausalenaga, amo na ga labea galibale inigia, helebesi ne mofeyo holobagabu ewehe ilidai belaguyo.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 16:4">Kis 16.4</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 16:14-15">14-15</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 16:33-34">33-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:48-50">Yon 6.48-50</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:2">Ais 62.2</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, idele inolo konenida labe gili, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenehe</char> sese suniafea sulu selaba yaafemo, nafuluba doma.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:17" />
  <para style="pm" vid="REV 2:17">Idele inolo abehe, dedeba besabi, yobolu kaamo adesenaga, ilifeamo <char style="sls"><char style="w">mena</char></char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fogo Isolaele hele falaiya ami siba aloiya ami, ine naiyomo </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mena. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Godehe ilifea </char><char style="it">mena</char> amo meba ado. Aulugulu, samini Isolaele ilihe <char style="it">mena</char> amo domalane naiyo mololu. Auluso, <char style="it">mena</char> iwi selefe amo, asubanene naiyo amone iminiba selefe. </note> muguba dobu amone, noolo Na meyobasu. Aufia, Nahe abane hoolu<note caller="†" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">abane hoolu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo eweguba iminife. Idele inolo abehe abane hoolu ewe difasia sebunaga, amofea miliyolu miliyo ada ami waagi sugamaleyobafe.</char></note> uleno, wi hilida amo saabia selelu dobumo, ilifea meyo. Wi hili selelu amo, inolo abaneda dife amo e-su, asigiyobafe.’ ”<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dailadaila sesefea sowi ewe seleba mebaimalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 1:14-15">MUU 1.14-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo amohe nafea saabia eweguba seleso. “Ga Dailadaila daunone <char style="w">sese</char> ami sulu dia ano labe amofea sowi seleba mesia, eweguba saama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:18" />
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 2:18">‘Na Godene Faibe lolu. Ne simo, de waiyagulu neeba labe. Aufia, ne emomo, aeyene kiwi kolelu de subulu genelugulu neeba labe.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 2:18">Na amo lolugulu, Na sulu ewe gafea seleba mebaisu.<verse eid="REV 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Mana sunia gili moloba adomo, Na asigibu. Gine hameselo mana amoda, gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> mana amoda, gili noolo anogo sagoba ofolo mana amoda, Na asigibu. Higinilu gili labea holobagasi, gili kiwi sanefia afolale amoda, Na asigibu. Aufia, mana nafulu aga gili molofe amohe, samini gili mololumo waseba suniafe, amoda Na asigibu.<verse eid="REV 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 16:31">1Kin 16.31</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:22">2Kin 9.22</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, Na gilifea hilisesiamo, gine mana Na haboba bolomo, ewe. Gilihe ido Yesebelemo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saminimo, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ido Yesebele </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo, Isolaelene kini Ahafone eamono asulu. E ido wolu ligia, masega godefea gulugulusia, Godene saaba ofolo woba dafaliba yaalo. Ene sadalu alegamale 1 King 16.30; 18.4; 19.1-2; 21.5-16, 23. Yesuhe iwi Dailadailane sese amofea sulu selesiamo, ido Yesebele seale amone saaba iminiba selefale. Aubale. E ido amone mana wolu iminiba selefe. </char></note> gilidai waagi mesesi gadefafia labe. Ido Yesebelehe ene meleba saaba selesiamo, na saaba ofolo ido loluba sodo. E walesiamo, ehe Ne dabalu mololo inolo noolo gegefasia, heleba luba dia abia, ili susugu mana molomesineda, kelebulu masega godefea soba meba adomo namenesineda, moloba walelo. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Nahe efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besimesifia</char> fogo meluso, e alefasia ene susugu mana mololomo afialesia susife. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Aufegulu, nahe walefa wolumo ido amofea meyo. Aufia, edai susuguda mololo idele inolo amo ilida, asigi besisia, wolu mololo amo afelesalenaga, amo nahe higinilu bule ilifeada meyo. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:9">Sng 7.9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Jer 17.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:12-13">MUU 20.12-13</ref></char></note>Aufia, Nahe ene faibilida danemesi yasoba dafaliyo. Auba ausi, sese suniahe hilisesia, Na idele inolone asigida, liboda, baafia isaloba hiliseyobafe. Aufia, Nahe elebi elebibafea elebe mesiamo, mana gine mololu amogubasu meyo.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Ido Yesebeleda kuliba ano ili selesia, “Nini <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenene</char> mugusilu asigi hilisebuba” sodo. Auluso, Dailadaila saabe gili noolomo, ido amo walefemo kuliba anale gilifea Na eweguba selesu. Molomalu sulu noda saabia no selesiale, gilifea ewesu molomalesu. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:11">MUU 3.11</ref></char></note>Kegele gili sebumo, fedoba sefiasu abia, Na saabi elomale.<verse eid="REV 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:8-9">Sng 2.8-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolo abehe, dedeba besabi, yobolu kaamo adesenaga, Ne dabalu molobasu ligia elosi, Nahe ilifea mosomu sunia uluba melesine, wi mesia, kiwigagaluda meyobasu. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />Aufia, <char style="qt">kaamo alolu ilihe aeyene kaidamo sefia, mosomu sunia kiwigaaba yasifia, uluba miliyobafe. Aufia, ilihe ine gisamo, gofo hele mololumo saidafogosi nenamuloguba, nenamuyobafe.</char> Dabalu nahe ilifea meyobasu ewemo, naohe Nafea idele inolo yasimesi dabalu melu amogubasu meyo. <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:16">MUU 22.16</ref></char></note>Aufia, sigabi keafa hiliasi gelo amoda, Na ilifea meyobasu.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Aulugulu, idele inolo konenida labe gili, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenehe</char> sese suniafea sulu selaba yaafemo, nafuluba doma.’ ”<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Sadisi sesefea sowi ewe seleba mebaimalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 1:4">MUU 1.4</ref>, <ref loc="REV 1:16">16</ref></char>
    </note>Inolo amohe nafea saabia eweguba seleso. “Ga Sadisi daunone <char style="w">sese</char> ami sulu dia ano labe amofea sowi seleba mesia, eweguba saama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:1" />
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 3:1">‘Godene Asubane domobamo Nafea ligia, na sigabi domobamo sefia lolu.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 3:1">Na amo lolugulu, Na sulu ewe gafea seleba mebaisu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:1" />
  <para style="pm" vid="REV 3:1">Mana sunia gili mololomo, Na asigibu. Noolohe gili saaba selaba adomo, Na asigibu. Amo ewe. Gili ogo bebea labeba soluso, aubale, gili danelu dobu. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Si kolafia mesa! Kiwi gili aso dobu ogo, sunia olalosi, haiba kiwigaamesi moloba homa. Maumo, dabalu gili mololumo, Godene si saabia moloba samodoluale labeba, Na auba eloba abulu. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43-44">Mad 24.43-44</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:5">MUU 2.5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:15">16.15</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:2">1Des 5.2</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, gili dofasia, asigiba dulumo, asigiba obegema. Amo fedoba sefia ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi haiba besima</char>. Auluso, gili si kolafia adesalenaga, Na fadilo inolo anoguba miyobasu. Ausia, Na miyo fogomo, gili asigibale labi, Na gili labea miyo. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:23">Yud 1.23</ref></char></note>Auluso, gine Sadisi sese aleba ugi, idele inolo ine faguloda nugumamesi mololualemo, aso bilale alebaibu. Ili ilililu alebaibugulu, ilimo fagulo hoolumo kakafia, Na galiba siba miliyobafe.<verse eid="REV 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:32-33">Kis 32.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:32">Mad 10.32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:8">Lug 12.8</ref></char>
    </note>Idele inolo abehe, dedeba besabi, yobolu kaamo adesenaga, amo ilihe fagulo hoolu auba kakaeyobafe. Aufia, ine wi Miliyolu Miliyo Bugo seleba dobumo, Na heeba dafiyale koleba. Aubale. Ine wimo, Ne Naone olegiada, Ene sulu dia anone olegiada, Nahe yuasiale ulufaba saeyobasu. <figure style="fig" alt="Sese Domoba Asia ami dobumo ewe" file="Map_Revelation.jpg" size="span" loc="3.6" ref="2.1-3.22">Sese Domoba Asia ami dobumo ewe</figure><verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Aulugulu, idele inolo konenida labe gili, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenehe</char> sese suniafea sulu selaba yaafemo, nafuluba doma.’ ”<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filadefia sesefea sowi ewe seleba mebaimalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 22:22">Ais 22.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo ewehe nafea saabia eweguba seleso. “Ga Filadefia daunone <char style="w">sese</char> ami sulu dia ano labe amofea sowi seleba mesia, eweguba saama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:7" />
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 3:7">‘<char style="w" lemma="Muuba Kalilu">Muuba Kalilu Noekenemo</char>, Na lolu. Aufia, Sealene Mau kolebamo, Na lolu. Aufia, kini <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> giida sebu amo, Na lolu. Aulune, kegele Na sogoba ofelefe amo, inolo uleno kaeyobafale. Aufia, kegele Na kaaba dafelefe amo, inolo uleno sogoyobafale.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 3:7">Na amo lolugulu, Na sulu ewe gafea seleba mebaisu.<verse eid="REV 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 16:9">1Kld 16.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mana gili moloba adomo sunia, Na asigibu. Bama. Gine olegia ugi, Nahe eno sogoba ufia lolugulu, inolo ulenohe kaeyobafale. Enebamo, Na hilisesia, gili kiwi wedino aso ligiamoda, Ne sulu amo fedoba sefia ligia, gilihe Ne wimo waaselaba bisigiale labeba hilisebu. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:9">MUU 2.9</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenene</char> mosomu alebaibu ili amo eweguba selesia, “Ninimo Gode molobebelelu mosomu loluba” sodomo, gili hilisebu. Auluso, ili amo Godeneale. Ili amo masega sodo alebaibu. Aulugulu, doma. Inolo ili amo, gili labea milifasia, gine emo sisa sauba hanefia alebaisia, ilihe eweguba eloba babiyobafe. Yesu Nahe, Filadefia sese ga hamesefebuba, ili auba eloba babiyobafe. Nahe ili auba aumesi moloba ufiyobasu. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:19">Lug 21.19</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 2:12">2Dim 2.12</ref></char></note>Na gilifea kiwi sanefia hamabiyoba sulu solumo, gili fedoba sefia alolune, dedeba babiyo fogo holobagasimo, Nada gili fedoba seyobasu. Helefealu kakainabu ilifea dedeba babiyone fogo amo, helefealu sunia iwi holobagaeyo saabemo, hagoalefe.<verse eid="REV 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Na alebale miyobasu. Kegele gili sesalibu ogomo, fedoba sesaimale. Kaamo alolumone habuga, gine gunia kakasia, momadaba ufulu ogomo, inolo ulenohe huba dafolosi.<verse eid="REV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 62:2">Ais 62.2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:15">65.15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:1">MUU 14.1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:2">21.2</ref></char>
    </note>Idele inolo abehe, dedeba besabi, yobolu kaamo adesenaga, ili amomo, Nahe ne Godene <char style="w">sebele molo</char> amone i kau kolelu melesi gadefaeyo. Aufia, ili molo amo haiba gadefia maiyobafale. Na ilifeamo Ne Godene wida, aufia Ne Godene sidine wida, seleba ufiyobasu. Godene sidi amo, Yelusalame hili labe. Sidi amo, Ne Godefeafia holobagafia, <char style="w">hebene</char> afasia suga saabe. Aufasia, Nahe Ne wi hili amoda, ilifea seleba ufiyo.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Aulugulu, idele inolo konenida labe gili, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenehe</char> sese suniafea sulu selaba yaafemo, nafuluba doma.’ ”<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laodisia sesefea sowi ewe seleba mebaimalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />Inolo ewehe nafea saabia eweguba seleso. “Ga Laodisia daunone <char style="w">sese</char> ami sulu dia ano labe amofea sowi seleba mesia, eweguba saama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:14" />
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 3:14">‘Seale Sodo, amo Na. Gahe asigi ule ufiyodolumo, amo Na. Godene sulu ulufaba sealeba saaba dafelagolomo, amo Na. Kegele sunia Gode mololu dobu amone Mau amomo, Na lolu.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 3:14">Na amo lolugulu, Na sulu ewe gafea seleba mebaisu.<verse eid="REV 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:11">Lom 12.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nahe mana gili moloba adomo asigibu. Gilimo, badiluale labe. Aufia, gilimo halolualeda labe. Yeele! Nahe gilimo badilu koleba, me halolu koleba, melalebaiyeba asigisu. <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Auluso, gilimo auba adesiale, gili olofa hamagi, halolualeda, badilualeda, labegulu, Nahe gili ne mofeyo usu labemo, isaba dafiyo weeiyasu. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:8">1Kld 4.8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:21">Lug 12.21</ref></char></note>Gili selesia, “Ninimo elebe wedinale digia, nini isoba soluba” sodo. “Nini kegele uleno kelelu maleba asigife.” Gili auba sodoso, gine melebamo nafuluba eloba besabale. Aubale. Seale, gili woba dafulu inolo ligia, weagulu ligia, yeeleba sodo idele inolo alebaibu. Aufia gili si kalalu alebaibu. Aufia, gili abagudoa alebaibu. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Ais 55.1</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, nahe gilifea asigi dimesi eweguba selesu. Gili elebeda ufulu miliyone, <char style="w">golo</char> de subulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Golo de sobolomo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, nuguma diba dafiyone sobolo. Dehe golo dasilesi, amone nuguma degelaba dafolo. Aufasia, golo amo haiba badifasia, kolelu alefasia, nugumada male adesia, elaleyobafe koleba. </char></note> elalelu Na sebu ewene, elegeyo milale. Aufasia, gili abagudoa ligia, yuafe ogone kaeyone, fagulo hoolu Na sebu ewene, elegeyo milale. Aufia, gine si haiba babiyone, si mulumulo na sebu ewene, elegeyo milale.<verse eid="REV 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 11:32">1Kld 11.32</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:6">Hib 12.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:5">MUU 2.5</ref></char>
    </note>Idele inolo Nahe hamesebu ilimo, Nahe ili amo halaleba sulu selesia isolo. Aulugulu, gine meleba kiwigaaba nafuluba helegeba adesia, gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besima</char>. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:23">Yon 14.23</ref></char></note>Doma! Na eno saliba yoba ligia, eno godogodoba lolu. Inolo abehe ne sulu goo dobelesia, eno sogosenaga, na inolo amo labea suga milifasia, na edai sigia, eda nadai sigia, ani ua naiyo naba misiyo.<verse eid="REV 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Samini, Na-mo kaamo alefasia abia, Ne Nao galiba, Ene kinine asefalu ailalu saabia yoba asulu. Amogubasu, Idele inolo abehe, dedeba besabi, yobolu kaamo adesenaga, amo Nahe ilimo Ne kinine asefalu ailalu saabia, na galiba waagi yoba mesesi gadefaeyobasu.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Aulugulu, idele inolo konenida labe gili, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenehe</char> sese suniafea sulu selaba yaafemo, nafuluba doma.’ ” <figure style="fig" alt="Knocking on door" file="44_Ac_12_07_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="3.20">Yesu eno saliba yoba ligia, eno godogodoba labe.</figure><verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-e</para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Hebene lagi, Godene wi digiba selaba ligia, guluguluba ado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 1:1">MUU 1.1</ref>, <ref loc="REV 1:10">10</ref></char>
    </note>Aufasia, ne olegiamo, nahe <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi eno uleno sogoba dobi abulu. Mofeyo goo, na samini fuulo galaloguba galasia, sulu selesi dubulumo, amohe saabia nafea selesia, “Ga iwi fela mila. Nahe gafea kegele ewene faisa holobagaeyobafemo waleyobasu”.<verse eid="REV 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:1">Ais 6.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alebale hamagi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane Noekenemo</char> nafea adesi, bosolufalumo, hebene lagimo, kinine asefalu ailalu uleno dobi abulu. Kinine asefalu ailaiya saabia amimo, uleno ami yoba saabeo. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:28">Ese 1.28</ref></char></note>Aufia, ami yoba asulumo, E elaleba neesiamo, abane hogale, <char style="it">yaseba</char> amoguludai, abane genelu, <char style="it">koniliane</char> amogulumodai neeloguso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gahe abane yogolelu amone biimo babiyo hilisesenaga, mimisililu amo, degelalu 704-da, 705-da, olofa ami dobu, bamale. </char></note> Sobaisagala uleno kinine asefalu ailalu amo amaleba galifia labeo. Sobaisagala amo abane imololu <char style="it">emelade</char> amogulu neeso. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Ausi, bosolufalumo, kinine asefalu ailalu daabuluba aidafia biniba noolomo, kinine asefalu ailalu amone amaleba galifia alebaibiyo. Aufia, guni inolo daabuluba aidafia biniba amo, kinine asefalu ailaiya saabia, yoba kakainafia labeo. Guni inolo ili amomo, fagulo hoolu sesela kakafia, ine guniamo habuga golo mololumo, saligafia alebaibiyo. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:13">Ese 1.13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:2">Sek 4.2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:4">MUU 1.4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 8:5">8.5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">11.19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16.18</ref></char></note>Kinine asefalu ailaiya amifia yabagelesia, gala galasia, hagana guduloguba, guduso. Aufia, kinine asefalu ailalu amone olegiamo, gamali domobamo waiyaba labeo. Amomo, Gode Ene asubane domoba amone iminife. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:5-10">Ese 1.5-10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 1:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:14">10.14</ref></char></note>Aufia, kinine asefalu ailaiya mia amimo, kegele uleno waiyo galulu bule ulenogulu dobiyo. Waiyo galulu amo, galagololu galasigulu dobiyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Kinine asefalu ailalu amone kulia biniba amimo, kegele bebeada labe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kegele bebeada labe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">selefe ewe, kegele amo wi fadaba soluale. Amo inoloale, me kelebuluale. Amenebi fadaba soluale dobu.</char></note> binibamo yoba alebaibiyo. Aufia, kegele bebeada labe biniba amomo, ine kubalefealoda, ine faisafealoda, si sunia adaaba yaabiyo. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Bebeada labe agelemo, <char style="w" lemma="Laeono">laeonogulu</char> besabeo. Aufia, bebeada labe aganebomo, dofene keao dofologulu besabeo. Aufia, bebeada labe osolomo, ene olegimo, inolone olegigulu besabeo. Aufia, bebeada labe binibomo, haga uso hauba dia silo amogulu besabeo. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:2">Ais 6.2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 6:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 1:18">Ese 1.18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:12">10.12</ref></char></note>Bebeada labe biniba amo, ule ulebafeamo, awi kaabebaba labeo. Aufia, ine domalafeada, ine awi sisa amofealoda, si sunia adaaba yaabiyo. Aufia, nigilibada, yaidada, ilihe eweguba saeyomo afolalebiyo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 4:8" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">“<char style="qt"><char style="w">Noekene</char>. </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">
    <char style="qt">Noekene. </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">
    <char style="qt">Noekene.</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">
    <char style="qt">Kiwigagalu suniane wasolumo, </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">
    <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Gode E,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">
    <char style="w" lemma="Muuba kalilu">Muuba Kalilu Noekene</char> labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">Labe amo E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">Alolu amo E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">Miyobafe amo E.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Bebeada labe ili amohe, kinine asefalu ailaiya saabia, yoba saabe Alefalu Miliyolu Ado amofea, Ene wi wabialeba mebasu adobiyo. Aufia, ilihe Ene wi digiba selaba ligia, auba wisoba selesia, heafubasu adobiyo. <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:10">MUU 7.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:4">19.4</ref></char></note>Ili auba ausi, guni inolo daabuluba aidafia biniba ilihe, kinine asefalu ailalu saabia ami Yoba Saabe Amofea, sauba hanefia, ilihe Alefalu Miliyolu Ado amo Efea gulugulubasu adobiyo. Aufia, ilihe habuga golo mololu, ine gunia kakalumo huba yaafasia, kinine asefalu ailalu olegia ami, diba waalefasia, gasa eweguba olabolobiyo.<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Saminilo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:11">Ga nine Gode-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:11">Ga ilililu koleba labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:11">Aulune, helefealu sunia</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:11">Ge kiwigagalu sisa labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:11">Suniahe Gafea wabialesia</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:11">Ge wi digimesi,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:11">Ga ililiba samodolu labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:11">Mau enebamo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:11">helefealu kegele sunia</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:11">Ga mololu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:11">Gene asigifeguba kuliba abia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:11">moloba holobagalune,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:11">kegele amo sunia</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:11">aga iwi labemone, labe-eee!”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Yonehe beba homogolu uleno kaaba dafulu dobi abulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:11">Ais 29.11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 2:9-10">Ese 2.9-10</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, na bosolufalumo, kinine asefalu ailalu saabia ami Yoba Saabe Amo Ene sone lilibefealo amohe, beba selelu homogolu sefia yoba saabi abulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kinine asefalu ailalu saabia Yoba Saabe Amo, Gode Nao amo E.</char></note> Beba amo nolobaloda, nolobaloda, seleba ofeleso. Homogofasia, beba enaoba ofelesia, gamali dadalu dudulusia, domoba amohe adagiliba ofelesia, kaaba dafulu dobiyo. <figure style="fig" alt="Scroll with seven seals" file="UW-Scroll_d.tif" size="col" copy="Urs Wegmann (SIL)" ref="5.1">Beba homogofia, gamali dadaluhe domoba adagiliba ofelesia, kaaba dafulu dobu.</figure> <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Aufia, na ami bosolufalumo, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> kiwida ulenohe eweguba koleba wuaaba seleso. “Gamali dadalu enaosia, adagiliba dobu amo olabofasia, beba homogolu ewe fisigaeyomo, abe ilililu koleba labebi?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Auba selesi, <char style="w">hebene</char> lagida, me helefealu iwida, me helefealu sisa iligida, beba homogolu amo fisigasia, usu selelu dobu amone alegaeyone, inolo ilililu ulenoda male kolebabiyo. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Beba homogolu amo fisigasia, alegaeyone ilililu inolo uleno baaba goleluale baafia, na bule koleba yeeba alolu.<verse eid="REV 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 49:9">Stt 49.9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Ais 11.1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 11:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:16">MUU 22.16</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, guni inolo aleba ami uleno nafea selesia, “Ga yeemabu. Bama! Kini <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> Faibe, Yuda mosomune <char style="w" lemma="Laeono">Laeonoba</char> sodo amo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kini Deibidine Faibe, Yuda mosomune Laeonoba sodo amo, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">E Yesuba selefe.</char></note> Ehe gisa kaamo alolu. Aulugulu, gamali dadalu domoba beba homogolu kaaba dafulu dobu amone, olabofasia fisigaeyomo, E koleba ilililu labeba” seleso.<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yonehe Dofene Sibi Edo abulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 4:10">Sek 4.10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:36">Yon 1.36</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:8">MUU 13.8</ref></char>
    </note>Auba selesi, na bosolufalumo, <char style="w">Dofene Sibi Edo</char> uleno kinine asefalu ailalu amone olegia ami yoba labi abulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dofene Sibi Edo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo, Yesu. Isolaele mosomu ili Isibi hele afiyo labi, molo ule uleba ili amohe, dofene sibi edo dufa dasigafia, amone ibimo eno salibane ikaufea heeba ufulu. Aulugulu, dofene sibi edo amomo, Godehe Isolaele mosomu Isibine sone usu alolumone, sububa dafelagoba dulu amone imini amo labe. Aulune, dofene sibi edo amomo, Yesu iminife. Yesu, E dufa olafia, nini sunia Sedenene sone usu alolumone sububa dafelagoba dulu.</char></note> Aufiamo, Dofene Sibi Edo amo, E dufa dasigalugulu besabeo. Aufia, bebeada labe biniba amoda, ausi, guni inolo ili amoda, E amaleba galifia alebaibiyo. Ene gunia ami, maide domobada, aufia si domobada, labeo. Amomo, Godene Asubane domoba helefealu sunia hilibaisalu amone iminife. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Ausi, Dofene Sibi Edo amo, abia, kinine asefalu ailalu saabia Yoba Saabe Amo saabea aaso. Aufia, Ehe Amone sone lilibefealo beba homogolu sebu amone diso. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:3-4">MUU 8.3-4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 141:2">Sng 141.2</ref></char></note>Aufia, Ehe beba homogolu amo difasia labi, bebeada labe biniba amoda, aufia guni inolo daabuluba aidafia biniba ilida, ili amohe Dofene Sibi Edo aniba ami, wabialesia sauba haneba gagaliso. Ili ule ulebahe gida galaloda sesailubiyo. Aufia, ili ule ulebahe gofo golo mololumo sesailubiyo. Amone usu iligifia, kawa kasineda nafulu felaso. Amomo, asigi ule ufulu idele inolohe <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selaba</char> yaafe amone iminife.<verse eid="REV 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-s</para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Dofene Sibi Edo amone wi digiba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 96:1">Sng 96.1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 98:1">98.1</ref></char>
    </note>Gofo golo auba sesaifia ligia, ilihe gasa hili olabofia, Dofene Sibi Edofea eweguba seleso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 5:9" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:9">“Beba homogolu ewe diyone, Ga-su ilililu koleba labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:9">Aufia, gamali dadalu adagilibumo olabofasia fisigaeyone,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:9">ililibu amo, Ga-su koleba labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:9">Mau enebamo, Ga dufa dasigalu labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:9">Amo alefasia, Ge ibi amohe, idele inolo elegeba difasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:9">Gahe ili amo Godefea melu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:9">Seale, Ge ibihe, idele inolo elegesiamo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:9">mosomu sunia amifiada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:9">sulu nonoba sodo sunia amifiada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:9">misi nonoba bolo sunia amifiada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:9">hele nonoba sunia amifiada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:9">ilimo elegeba dulu-ooo!<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:6">Kis 19.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:6">Ais 61.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:6">MUU 1.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:6">20.6</ref></char>
    </note>Auba elegeba difasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:10">Gahe ili amo kinine mosomu moloba ofelesia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:10">ili nine Godefea melu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:10">Aufia, Gahe ili amo <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melo idele inolo</char> melesi gadefabu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:10">Ausi, ili amo kini adaaba yaasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:10">helefealu idele inolo sunia uluba ligia, yasiyobafe-eee!”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:10">Dan 7.10</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:22">Hib 12.22</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, na haiba bisigia, dobelesufalumo, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> saludiale wamilimo sulu gala dafelesi dubulu. Ili amohe kini asefalu ailalu amoda, aufia bebeada labe biniba amoda, aufia guni inolo ili amoda, amaleba galifia alebailubiyo. Ili amone alegalumo, saii daabulubane dabaluba suniafia, alegalu amogulubiyo. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Ili amohe gasa wuaaba koleba eweguba seleso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 5:12" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:12">“<char style="w">Dofene Sibi Edo</char> ilihe dufa dasigalu E-mo, ilililu labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:12">Kiwigagaluda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:12">elebeda ufulu amoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:12">dawaloloda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:12">kiwi koleluda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:12">wabialeloda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:12">
    <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elaleluda</char>,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:12">wi buleda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:12">amo sunia diyone, E ilililu koleba labe-eee!”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Sulu dia ano wamili ilihe gasa auba selaba labi, kegele Gode mololu sunia, <char style="w">hebene</char> alebaibu ili amoda, aufia helefealu iwi alebaibu ili amoda, aufia helefealu sisa alebaibu ili amoda, aufia salu hano galulu usu alebaibu ili amoda, ili amo suniahe, gasa eweguba seleso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 5:13" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:13">“Kinine asefalu ailalu saabia Yoba Saabe amofeada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:13">Dofene Sibi Edo amofeada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:13">aine wi digima-aaa!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:13">Aine elaleluda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:13">aine kiwigagaluda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:13">amone heneba ligia, aalufea heafusia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:13">wabialeba selabasu ligia, alefalu mela-aaa!”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Gasa auba saaba samodosi, bebeada labe biniba ili amo selesia, “<char style="sls"><char style="w">Amen</char>.</char> Amo seale koleba.” Ausi, guni inolo ilihe sauba hanefia, aalufea gulugulusia wi digiba seleso.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-e</para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Dofene Sibi Edohe gamali dadalu adagiliba ufulumo olaboba dafalilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 4:6">MUU 4.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:1">5.1</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, na sidafia labi, <char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi edo">Dofene Sibi Edohe</char> beba homogolufea gamali dadalu adagililu domoba baalu amone, agelemo maugaba olaboba dafeleso. Ausi, na dobelesia, bebeada labe biniba amo ulenohe, hagana guduloguba wuaaba selesia, “Mila!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:8">Sek 1.8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:1-6">6.1-6</ref></char></note>Ausi, na saabia bisigia, bosolufalumo, <char style="w">dofene hoso</char> hoolu uleno kalugaafia labeo. Dofene hoso saabia ami, inolo uleno asefasia, ibolo uleno sefia yoba saabeo. Ilihe ene gunia kaamo alolu amone habuga uleno saligaba ofelesia, momadaba ofeleso. E kaamo adabiasu abia, kaamo miliyofia aaso.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Aufasiamo, Dofene Sibi Edohe gamali dadalu adagililu amone, aganebomo olaboba dafeleso. Auba ausi, bebeada labe aganebomo selesia, “Mila!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Auba selesi, dofene hoso de iso genelugulumo ami holobagaso. Inolo dofene hoso amo saabia asulu amofea helebesi selale uleno meso. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealo mana</char> helefealu saabe ewene diba dafiyone, inolo amofea kiwi mesia gadefaso. Aufia, idele inolo ine geleba yobosia dufa danemesine, kiwigagalu efea auba meso.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Aufasiamo, Dofene Sibi Edohe gamali dadalu adagililu amone, osolomo olaboba dafeleso. Auba ausi, bebeada labe osolomo selesia, “Mila!” Auba selesi, haiba bisigia, bosolufalumo, dofene hoso yabulu uleno ami kalugaafia labeo. Inolo dofene hoso saabia yoba saabe amohe, higiniba osolaeyone iminilo kegele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Higiniba osolaeyone iminilo kegele </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amomo, naiyo osolaeyone kegele. Higiniba osolaeyone iminilo kegele inolo ewefea melu amo, mamia gi miyobafe amone dedeba iminife. Enebamo, naiyo abobosenaga, ili naiyo higiniba osolaba iminifia meba yaalo.</char></note> uleno ene sone sefia yoba saabeo. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Ausi, bebeada biniba labe aleba ami, inolone mofeyo goo sodoguba saaba dafelagosia, selesi dobelesufalumo, inolo dofene hoso saabia saabe amofea eweguba seleso. “Mamia gi bule holobagamesi, ga moloba homale. Ausi, ilifeamo hilia ule dabalu mololu amone elebe elegesiamo, inolo ulene naiyo falawa, nolugulu, amosu meyobafe. Aufia, hilia ulenone dabalu molofasiamo, dabalu mololu amone elegesiamo, desi <char style="w" lemma="Desi bali">bali</char> gaabu osoloa amosu meyobafe. Auluso, <char style="w">olifi</char> idai, <char style="w">waini</char> efolodai, ga woba dafalimabiyo.”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Aufasiamo, Dofene Sibi Edohe gamali dadalu adagililu amone, binibo olaboba dafeleso. Auba ausi, bebeada labe binibo selesia, “Mila!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:21">Ese 14.21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 5:17">5.17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:1-3">Jer 15.1-3</ref></char></note>Ausi, ne miafealo bosolufalumo, dofene hoso wanogulu kalugaafia labeo. Inolo hoso saabia ami asefasia saabe amo, ene wimo, Olalo. Aufia, e faisa kuliba aafe amone wimo, Daneba Yaalu Yasiba Ada.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Daneba Yaalu Yasiba Ada</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, sulu amo Giligi sulubamo <char style="it">Hades</char>ba sodo amone besife.</char></note> Aalufeamo kiwi mesia, helefealu idele inolo sunia, hele fogo biniba alegalu amimo, hele fogo osoloamo afelesia, ulenomo dufa danemesi kiwi meso. Idele inolo noolomo, helebesi dufa daneyobafe. Idele inolo noolomo, mamia gi holobagasia, daneba yaeyobafe. Aufia noolomo, walefa gi disia, daneba yaeyobafe. Aufia, ilo kelebulu helefealu iwi alebaibu amohe, noolo yasoba daneyobafe.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Aufasiamo, Dofene Sibi Edohe gamali dadalu adagililu amone, bimo olaboba dafeleso. Aufia, na bisigia, bosolufalumo, idele inolo yasoba dasigaba yaalu ilimo, ulu <char style="w">soba meyone defene olabolu</char> aniba ami alebaibiyo. Saminimo, idele inolo ili amohe Godene sulu mana fedoba sefia walebasu alolune, ilihe ili amo yasoba dasigalubiyo. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Ili amohe koleba wuaasia, eweguba seleso. “Nine Biso, Ga <char style="w">noekene</char> ligia, seale koleba labene, Gahe helefealu kakainabu ili amo osolasiamo, ninida yasoba dafalilu ili amone sabesia, nine ibi daalu ilifea obegeba meyomo, ninihe hilia halagia yasiyobi?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:9">MUU 7.9</ref>, <ref loc="REV 7:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:14">19.14</ref></char></note>Auba doba besabi, ili ule ulebafea fagulo hoholu sesela meba yaasiamo, eweguba seleso. “Gili halemane adesia, aso wedino baaba mela. Gilifaba ua dabalu mololoda, gine damenedalida, yasoba dafalilu amone alegalu ililisi, ami ilifea sabeyobafe.”<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mad 24.29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:20">HD 2.20</ref>; <ref loc="REV 8:12">MUU 8.12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:13">11.13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16.18</ref></char>
    </note>Na ami sidafia labi, Dofene Sibi Edohe gamali dadalu adagililu amone, kaabemo olaboba dafelesi, heleli bule koleba sigiso. Auba ausimo, halo yabusia, faiyulu alugulu yabulu holobagasi, aubemo, ibigulu genelu koleba holobagaso. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Ais 34.4</ref></char></note>Auba ausi, anakiwi lagifia, sigabi helefealu iwi suga milibaiso. Sigabi hodobaisasiamo, fafiye aso galu gegeneluale, mogaifo inigia fuusi, hodobaisaloguba, hodobaisaso. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:20">MUU 16.20</ref></char></note>Anakiwimo, beba homogologuba, homogolabia abia asigileso. Ausi, hele gale gagaba yaaluda, saidudu adaaba yaaluda, ilida adaaba yaiyamo afasia, gigiliba dedaleba yaaso.<verse eid="REV 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:10">Ais 2.10</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 2:19">19</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 2:21">21</ref></char>
    </note>Auba ausimo, helefealune kini inoloda, aufia guni inoloda, yobolone guni inoloda, elebeda ufulu inoloda, kiwida inoloda, aufia widale inoloda, wida inoloda, ili amo fisaba dedalefia, hele libo muguba misiyo dedaleso. Aufia, noolomo fisaba dedalefia, hele galea abane sodolo labe amone aniba, muguba misiyo dedaleso. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10.8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:30">Lug 23.30</ref></char></note>Ilihe hele gale adaaba yaabufeada, abane gegeba yaabufeada, eweguba wuaaba seleso. “<char style="qt">Gili koleba, nini saabia olaboba dowema!</char> Kinine asefalu ailalu saabia Yoba Saabe Amo, Ehe nini bolosi, gasiaguba yaama! Dofene Sibi Edo amo Ene kanolo ninifea holobagalosi, nini haguba yaama! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:11">Jol 2.11</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:2">Mal 3.2</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, aine kanolo amone hilia bule aga holobagabugulu, kiwigaafia kalugaeyobafemo, uleno koleba labela?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Godehe 144,000 idele inolomo Ene-sia enaoba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:36">Jer 49.36</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:2">Dan 7.2</ref></char>
    </note>Ewene faisamo, na bisigia, bosolufalumo, hele kulia biniba ami, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> biniba degeba yaafia labi abulu. Ilihe ami ligia, hele kulia biniba amone fufulo seba fedofia ligia, fufulohe helefealufeada, salu hano galulufeada, me i adaaba yaabufeada, fuuba dowelosifia kaaso. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Aufia, sulu dia ano no, halo holobagalofealofia saabi na abulu. Ehe Gode Bebeada Labe amone enaosia iminiba ufiyone kegele sefia saabeo. Ehe helefealuda, salu hanoda woba dafiyone kiwigagaluda melu sulu dia ano biniba amofea, koleba wuaaba eweguba seleso. <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Ese 9.4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 9:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:4">MUU 9.4</ref></char></note>“Ninihe Godene dabalu mololo widale inoloda, wida inoloda, ine olegia imini amo aso enaosia iminiba ofale labi, gilihe helefealuda, salu hanoda, i adaaba yaabuda, aso woba damabiyo.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:1">MUU 14.1</ref>, <ref loc="REV 14:3">3</ref></char></note>Aufia, idele inolo Godeneba enaosia iminiba waalelu amone alegalumo, ili selesi na dubulu. Ili <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu sunia amone damene nonoba, amone idele inolo alegalumo, 144,000.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dawalolu inolo noolo eweguba hilisefe. Namba alegalu 144,000 amo, mimisililune namba. Namba 12 amomo, ililiba samodolune alegalu namba iminife. Aufia, 12 saabia 12 alegafe amo, 144 amone alegafe. Aufia, 1,000 amomo, wasigalune namba iminife. Aulugulu, 144,000 iwi selefe amo, namba wasigafia, ililiba samodolu kolebaba iminife. (12 x 12,000 = 144,000). Amo idele inolo saludiale, alegaeyodoluale amone iminife. Nini yau idele inoloda, Yesune wifea alefasia, Isolaele mosomune alegalu usu ami, ilidai gegoaba alegaeyobafe. (Buk Song 87.6 alegamale.) </char></note><verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Yuda mosomu amifia, saii huguluba (12,000) amo enaosia iminiba waalelubiyo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:5">Lubene mosomufiamo, saii huguluba (12,000).</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:5">Gada mosomufiamo, saii huguluba (12,000).<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />Asele mosomufiamo, saii huguluba (12,000).</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:6">Nafadali mosomufiamo, saii huguluba (12,000).</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:6">Manase mosomufiamo, saii huguluba (12,000).<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />Saimiono mosomufiamo, saii huguluba (12,000).</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:7">Lifai mosomufiamo, saii huguluba (12,000).</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:7">Isaka mosomufiamo, saii huguluba (12,000).<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />Sebuluno mosomufiamo, saii huguluba (12,000).</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:8">
    <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[1]], Yekobone faibe hugulubamone ulenomo, e">Yosebe</char> mosomufiamo, saii huguluba (12,000).</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:8">Aufia, Benisamene mosomufiamo, saii huguluba (12,000) enaoba waalelubiyo.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo wamili wedinalehe Godene wi digiba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Amone faisamo, nahe idele inolo wamili wedinalemo, alegaeyoda babealu amone, alebaibi abulu. Idele inolo ami gagaiyolumo, hele nonoba sunia amifiada, mosomu nonoba sunia amifiada, misi nonoba bolo sunia amifiada, sulu nonoba sodo sunia amifiada, yoba alebaibiyo. Gagaiyofia, kinine asefalu ailalu amone olegia ligia, <char style="w">Dofene Sibi Edo</char> amone olegia yoba alebaibiyo. Idele inolo ili amo fagulo sesela hoholu siligaba kakafia, samia walu sesaifia ligia, walegesia waaleso. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:10">MUU 4.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:6-7">5.6-7</ref></char></note>Ili koleba wuaaba selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 7:10" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:10">“Nine Gode, kinine asefalu ailalu saabia yoba saabe amodai,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:10">Dofene Sibi Edo amodai,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:10">Aalu amohe</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:10">nini <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> obegeba dulune,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:10">nini helegeba nafulu kakinabu.”<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Aufia, sulu dia ano ili amo suniahe, kinine asefalu ailalu amoda, guni inolo ili amoda, bebeada biniba labe amoda, ili labea amaleba galifia alebaibiyo. Auba amaleba galifia alebaifia, ili amo sunia ine olegia sauba haneba fufunaloba ilogofia, Godefea guluguluba alebaibiyo. <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:12">MUU 5.12</ref></char></note>Gulugulusia, ilihe eweguba seleso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 7:12" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:12">“<char style="sls"><char style="w">Amen</char>!</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:12">Amo seale koleba-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:12">Nine Gode-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:12">Ninihe Ge wi digisu-ooo.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:12">Ewe seale koleba-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:12">
    <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">Elalelumo</char>, Ga labe-eee.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:12">Dawalolumo, Ga labe-eee.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:12">Wabialelomo, Ga labe-eee.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:12">Kiwigagalumo, Ga labe-eee.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:12">Amo seale koleba alefalu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 7:12">
    <char style="sls">Amen!</char>”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo higinilu dulu amone nagamo aga elofe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Aufasia, guni inolo aleba ami, ulenohe nafea doba bisigia, selesia, “Idele inolo fagulo hoholu sesela kakafia, alebaibu ili ewe abe, ili ewe waagifia milibailu?” <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:21">Mad 24.21</ref></char></note>Ausi, na obegeba selesia, “Inolo bule, gene ga asigibu.” Ausi, e nafea selesia, “Idele inolo ili ewe, gisa inolohe ilifea higinilu buledai, nagadai, mesi diaba alolu amone holobagagafia alebaibu. Ilihe ine fagulomo <char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi edo">Dofene Sibi Edone</char> ibi usu heesi, hoolu holobagagafia labe.<verse eid="REV 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Aulugulu, ili ewe Gode asefalu ailalu amone olegia ami, kalugagafia ligia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:15">yaidada, nigilibada, Ene sebele moloa ami ligia, Ene dabalu molosia adaaba yaalo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:15">Kinine asefalu ailalu saabia Yoba Saabe Amohe, ili uluba ligia, ilidai misiyobafe.<verse eid="REV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:10">Ais 49.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">Aufia, ili amo saabia haiba no mamiayobafale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:16">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, ili amo saabia no dogaeyo falayobafale. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:16">Haloda, kegele halolu nooloda, amohe ili dasiyobafale.<verse eid="REV 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 25:8">Ais 25.8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 23:2">Sng 23.2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:4">MUU 21.4</ref></char>
    </note>Maumo, Dofene Sibi Edo, E kinine asefalu ailalu amone olegia ami yoba labe amo, Ehe ili uluba miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:17">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, Ehe ili amo, miliyolu melo hano sugulo dugulesia udiaba ada ami, hano namenesi luba dibia maiyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:17">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, Godehe ine si hano miliba alolumo heesi, ami eloyobafe.</char>”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Dofene Sibi Edohe gamali dadalu adagililu amone domomo olabolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Dofene Sibi Edohe gamali dadalu adagililu domomo olabosi, <char style="w">hebene</char> lagimo kegele sunia waminisiale heefia ligia, halosi aoa haisi uleno amogulu adeso. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Aufia dufia, na bisigia, bosolufalumo, sulu dia ano domobamo Godene olegia ada ami kalugagafia labeo. Aufia, ilifea belo fuulo domobamo meba yaaso.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 5:8">MUU 5.8</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 30:1-3">Kis 30.1-3</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, na bisigia, bosolufalumo, sulu dia ano no saabi, na abulu. E inigia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba meyone defene olabolu">soba meyone defene olaboiya</char> ami miliyo saabeo. Ehe sao kasineda seyone golo disi uleno selubiyo. Ausi, ilihe sao kasineda nafulu saludiale efea meso. Ausi, ehe sao amodai, sulu <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> suniahe Edai solu amodai, disi usu ua gegoaba ofeleso. Auba ofasia, amo golohe defene olaboiya ami soba meyone diba ofeleso. Soba meyone defene olabolu amo Godene asefalu ailalu amone olegia ami dobiyo. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Auba ausi, golo disi ene sone sebia amifia, kawa kasineda nafulu Gode labea felaso. Sulu sigidubulu idele inolohe Godedai solu amoda felabia, Godene olegia goaso. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:12">Wkp 16.12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 19:16-19">Kis 19.16-19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">MUU 11.19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16.18</ref></char></note>Ausi, sulu dia ano amohe, soba meyone defene olaboiya amifia de difasia, disi usu fofaso. Aufia, disi fofalu amo helefealu saabia guguba dafogoso. Auba ausimo, yabagelesia, hagana fisasia, gala dafelesia, heleli sigiso.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sulu dia ano domoba amo aleba ami biniba ilidale belo fuulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Aufia, sulu dia ano domoba amohe belo fuulo domobamo sesaifia ligia, fuuyone madenefia alebaibiyo.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Sulu dia ano agelehe, ene belomo fuusi, hele-kano badiluda, deda, ibidai besifasia, helefealu saabia guguba dafogoso.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="REV 8:7">Ausi, helefealu amone haisi osoloa amone, ulenomo de naaso.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="REV 8:7">Aufia, i suniane haisi osoloa amone, ulenomo de naaso.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="REV 8:7">Aufia, gisi hagaea sunia amoda, de naaso.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Aufasia, sulu dia ano aganebohe, ene belomo fuusi, hele gale bule uleno, de waiyada alolu amogulumo, salu hano galulu usu ami dafogosi, hodobaiso.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="REV 8:8">Ausi, salu hano galulu amone, hano haisi osoloa amone, ulenomo ibi adeso.<verse eid="REV 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />Ausi, salu hano galulu usu ami bebeada alebaibu amone, haisi osoloa amone, ulenomo daneba yaaso.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="REV 8:9">Aufia, hano sibi ami sibaisafe amone, haisi osoloa amone, ulenomoda woba dafeleso.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Aufasia, sulu dia ano osolohe, ene belomo fuusi, sigabi aiyeeba daalu, gele waiyagulu, anakiwifia hodobaiso. Hodobaisiamo, hano sodolo dobia amida, hano sugulo dobia amida, hodobaiso. Hano sunia dobia amiale. Hano haisi osoloa amone, haisi ulesu dobia ami hodobaiso. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:15">Jer 9.15</ref></char></note>Sigabi amone wimo, Kabilu.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="REV 8:11">Amo hodobailu dobi, helefealu hano amo sunia amone, haisi osoloa amone, ulenomo kabilu adeso. Hano kabilu amo naasi, idele inolo wedinale daneba yaaso.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Ese 32.7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">MUU 6.12-13</ref></char>
    </note>Aufasia, sulu dia ano binibohe, ene belomo fuusi, haloda, aubeda, sigabida, amone haisi osoloane, ulenomo dowesi, haisi amone yanemo nigiligagaso.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="REV 8:12">Ausi, yaidada, nigilibada, amone haisi osoloa amone, haisi ulenomo nigili gagaba disia, yaneda male dobiyo.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 9:12">MUU 9.12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:14">11.14</ref></char>
    </note>Na ami sidafia labi, dobelesufalumo, uso uleno anakiwi dogolea lagi, hauba dia sisia, koleba wuaasia, eweguba selesi dubulu. “Yeele, Yeele, Yeele! Sulu dia ano noolo osoloa aso fuuluale amohe, ine belomo fuusi, idele inolo sunia helefealu kakainabia amimo, higinilu bule holobagaeyobafe.”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="s">Sulu dia ano bihe belo fuulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 20:1">MUU 20.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sulu dia ano bihe ene belomo fuusi, nahe bisigia, bosolufalumo, sigabi uleno anakiwifia helefealu saabia hodobailu dobi abulu. Aufia, ilihe hele gogolu ulumaluda male amone enone giimo, sigabi hodobailu amofea meso. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:28">Stt 19.28</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:2">Jol 2.2</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 10:12-15">Kis 10.12-15</ref></char></note>Sigabihe hele gogolu amone eno sogoba ofelesi, de kawa, naiyo yufiyone abane bule sobelesi, de kawa bule holobagaloguba, eno amifia holobagasi, halodai, anakiwidai, gasiagusia, nigiligagaso. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />De kawa aleba amifia, galiawa wedinale holobagagafia, helefealu saabia goaba yaaso. Ili amo alefasia, maidegana helefealu alebaibu amone kiwigagalu amogulu diso. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:3">MUU 7.3</ref></char></note>Galiawafea sulu saaba mesiamo, eweguba seleso. “Gili helefealu iwi dedalesiamo, gisida, edo geluda, ida, woba dafalimabiyo. Aubale. Gilihe idele inolo Gode Ene-ba enaosia, imini ine olegia waalebuale amofeasu, naga meba yaamale. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Idele inolo amo dufa olasialeso, aube bia aleba ami naga waagi memalelu.” Galiawa ili amofea auba saaba melubiyo. Naga galiawa ewe mefemo, maideganahe mubagasi, nagaba yaaloguba, nagaeyobafe. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:21">Jop 3.21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:3">Jer 8.3</ref></char></note>Fogo amoyamo, idele inolohe olaeyone eno isaeyobafeso, ili eno babiyobafale. Ili olabaiyeba hameyobafeso, olalo amo ili labea amifia hago fisaba maiyobafe.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:4">Jol 2.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Galiawa ili amomo, <char style="w">dofene hoso</char> belaguyo maiyone madenefia alolu amogulu, besabeo. Aufia, ine gunia kaamo alolune momada amogulu, habuga <char style="w">golo</char> mololu kakafia labimo, ine olegimo, inolone olegi mimisililu amogulu besabeo. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:6">Jol 1.6</ref></char></note>Ine guni alumo, hagolu idelene guni alu sesela amogulu besabeo. Aufia, ine besemo <char style="w" lemma="Laeono">laeonone</char> bese amogulu besabeo. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:5">Jol 2.5</ref></char></note>Ine hamesa aeyene mololugulu kakafia alebaibiyo. Aufia, ine awihe galafemo, dofene hoso wedinale yoboyone naguba dedalesia, galaloguba galasi, dobeleso. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Galiawa amone wafeda, maideda, maideganane wafeda, maideda, amogulu besabeo. Ine wafe usu amimo, idele inolomo aube bia aleba ami mubagasia, naga bule meyone, kiwigagalu ililiba selubiyo. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Sulu dia ano, hele gogolu ulumaluda male amone yasiba labe amo, e galiawane kini ado. <char style="w">Hibulu</char> suluba sulu dia ano amone wimo, Abadonoba sodo. Aufia, Giligi suluba selesiamo, Abolianiba sodo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abadono</char><char style="ft" closed="false">dai </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aboliani</char><char style="ft" closed="false">dai amone sisamo, nine suluba selesiamo, Kegele Sunia Woba Dafoloba sodo. Amo henane iminiba selefe.</char></note><verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Aga, Yeele-ba solu agelemo samodofia labe. Nafuluba, Yeele-ba solu aida no aso holobagaeyo dobu.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sulu dia ano kaabehe belo fuulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Sulu dia ano kaabe amohe ene belomo fuusi, nahe mofe goo ulenohe sulu selesi dubulu. Godene olegia ami, ulu <char style="w" lemma="Soba meyone defene olabolu">soba meyone defene olaboiya</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Defene olabolu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo golohe mololu.</char></note> kulia biniba amimo, maide biniba gagabiyo. Maide amofeafia, mofeyo goo amohe sulu saaba dafelagoso. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Mofeyo goo amohe sulu dia ano kaabe, belo fuuloda seba saabe, amofea selesia, “Gahe sulu dia ano biniba hano bule Yufuledisi saiya ami dofaba waalebugo, ili ogo dedalemesi, fisigasia sububa dafalibagoma.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:7-12">MUU 8.7-12</ref></char></note>Mofeyo goo auba selesi, sulu dia ano kaabe amohe, sulu dia ano biniba ogo sububa dafogoba ilogoso. Ili dedalesia, helefealu idele inolo suniane haisi osoloa amone, haisi ulenomo waagi yasoba danemesine, sububa dafogoba ilogoso. Sulu dia ano biniba amo, dofaba ufiya yasiba ligia, hamuda, aubeda, hiliada, halosi amoyamo koleba holobagamesifia, ami madeneba waalelubiyo. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Aufia, inolo hoso saabia asefia belaguyo dedalefe amone alegalumo, 200 miliene (200,000,000) alebaibiyo. Inolo nohe alegalu amo nafea selesi dubulu.<verse eid="REV 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Na si halaga amo bisigia, <char style="w">dofene hoso</char> saabia kakainafia dedalefe, ili amone hamesa wakayone kakalumone biimomo, de waiyagulu gegeneluda, hogalegulu kolebada, aufia wanoguluda, amogulu bebeleso. Aufia, dofene hoso ili amone gunimo, <char style="w" lemma="Laeono">laeonone</char> gunigulu beaba yaaso. Aufia, de kawada, de waiyada, salofane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Salofamo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">abane wanogulu, kasine wolu dobolo. Kasine wolu amo, hagaiso sesenelu dobologuba, kalololu dobolo. </char></note> hoo kasine kalololu amoda, dofene hoso amone mofeofeafia holobagagaba yaaso. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Helefealu idele inolo suniane haisi osoloa amone, haisi ulenomo, higinilu gi osoloa amohe dufa daneba yaaso. Higinilu gi osoloa ogo, ewe. De waiyada, de kawada, salofane hoo kasine kalololu amoda, dofene hosone mofeyofeafia holobagagalu amo auso. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Dofene hoso ili amone kiwigagalumo, ine mofeyodai, ine wafedai, ami dobiyo. Hoso amone wafemo, soiye aiyanegulu adesia, amone asusia gunida alebaibiyo. Guni amohe idele inolo muba gagaba yaaso.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 16:9">MUU 16.9</ref>, <ref loc="REV 16:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:4-7">Sng 115.4-7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:15-18">135.15-18</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:23">Dan 5.23</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, idele inolo, higinilu gi amohe yasoba dafaliluale, siba dafulu alebaibu ili amomo, wolu ine sone mololumo aso fogaba selesale. Aubale. Ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Gamodo">gamodofea</char> gulugulufemo afelesiale, aufia <char style="w">masega gode</char> goloda, silifada, <char style="w" lemma="Bolonoso">bolonosoda</char>, abaneda, ifea mololuda, afolaba yaasale. Masega gode ili ogo bolale ligia, dobolale ligia, siba adale alebaibu. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Idele inolo ili amohe ine dufa danelomoda, gone mololomoda, susugu mololomoda, aufia fa dilomoda, mana amo sunia afolaba yaasuba fogaba selesale.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Yonehe bugo wedinomo mofeyo mololu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Ausi, na bosolufalumo, sulu dia ano no, kiwigagaluda, <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> suga saabi abulu. Ehe kenemo, fagulogulu saligafia, sobaisagalada ene guni saabia amaleba ufia, ene olegimo halo neegulu, aufia ene emo aidamo, de waiyagulu besabeo. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Sulu dia ano amohe, bugo wedino uleno fisigalu ene sone sefia labeo. Ene emo inaloalomo, salu hano galulu saabia emelafia ligia, ene emo fofonaloalomo, helefealu saabia emelaso. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Ausi, e, <char style="w">laeono</char> hulologuba, koleba wuaaso. E auba wuaafia labi, hagana domoba gudusia, efea obegeba sodoguso. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:4">Dan 12.4</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 12:9">9</ref></char></note>Hagana domoba gudufasia afelesimo, hagana amohe sulu solumo na seleyofia labi, auluso sulu no hebenefia selesi dobelesia, eweguba seleso. “Sulu hagana gudulu domobahe selefe amo, ge asigi muguba homa, ulufaba selemabu.”<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:40">Lo 32.40</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:7">Dan 12.7</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, sulu dia ano salu hano galulu saabiada, helefealu saabiada, emelafia yoba labeo amohe, ene sone ililibemo hebenefealo digiba lagoso. <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />Sone auba digiba lagofia, ehe koleba <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiisia</char> selesia, “Fogo adomo, saabia no male miliyobafe. Alefalu bebeada labe Gode amone wi alefasia, na sulu amo sealeba aiiba selesu. Hebeneda, kegele amofea waalebu suniada, mololu Gode amo E. Aufia, helefealuda, kegele amofea waalebu suniada, mololu amo E. Aufia, salu hano galuluda, kegele usu ami waalebu suniada, mololu amo E. <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 3:7">Amo 3.7</ref></char></note>Sulu dia ano domo amohe ene belomo fuiyobafea hilia ami, Godene mugusilu muguba ufulu amo ene iminiba ufuluiya ami, holobagaeyobafe. Godehe ene <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> dabalu mololo inolofea samini waleba yaalugulu, moloyobafe.” Sulu dia ano amohe auba aiiba seleso.<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Auba ausi, sulu goo, samini hebene lagifia selesi na dubulumone, saabia selesiamo nafea eweguba seleso. “Ga abiamo, sulu dia ano, ene emo nomo salu hano galulu saabia, ene emo nomo helefealu saabia emelafia labea ami goafia, bugo ene sone saabia fisigaba dobu amone, dia mala.” <verse eid="REV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:8-3:3">Ese 2.8–3.3</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, na sulu dia ano labea daafia, bugodeno sebumo nafea memesi haalilu. Ausi, e nafea selesia, difasia namenaba seleso. <char style="qt">“Ogohe ge libo muba gagaiyobafe. Auluso, ge mofeyomo age hano nenalebalu nologuba naiyobafe.”</char> <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Auba selesi, nahe bugodeno amo, sulu dia anone sonehe seba labeafia, difasia mololu. Na mofeyomo, age hano nenalebaloguba naaso. Auluso, na gulubaisimo, amohe ne libo muba gagaso.<verse eid="REV 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Aufasia, sulu no nafea eweguba seleso. “Gahe saabia saaba ofa walelabia abia, idele inolo wedinale misi bolo nonobada, aufia hele nonobada, aufia sulu sodo nonobada, kini nonobada, ilifea kegele dufia holobagaeyobafe amone walelabia malaba” seleso.<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Inolo aidahe Godene sulu saaba dafelagolu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:3">Ese 40.3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:1-2">Sek 2.1-2</ref></char>
    </note>Aufasia, iminiyone i aafo uleno nafea mesia, sulu nafea eweguba seleso. “Ga sefia daafia, Godene <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molodai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Soba meyone defene olabolu">soba meyone defene olaboludai</char>, iminiyo mala. Iminifasia, ili ami gulugululo amoda alegamale. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:24">Lug 21.24</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:5">MUU 13.5</ref></char></note>Auluso, gahe sebele molo amone saloalumo iminimabiyo. Mau enebamo, saloalu amo <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolofea</char> melu dobiyo. Ili amohe aube daabuluba binibafia aida aleba ami, ne sidi <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">noekenemo</char> wobasubale yasifia miliyobafe. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Aufiamo, Nahe ne sulu saaba dafelagolo aidamofea kiwi mesi, aaluhe yagunagalo fagulo kaafia ligia, hilia alegalu 1,260 aleba amimo ne sulu saaba ofolaba miliyobafe.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Inolo aida ewemo, <char style="qt"><char style="w" lemma="Olifi">olifi i</char></char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Samini, saaba ofolo Sekalaea ehe </char><char style="fq" closed="false">olifi i aida eweda , naafa selo aida eweda</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, amone iminiba saaba ufulu. (Sekaraia 4.11-14 ami bamale) Inolo aida ewe naafa seba ofolo amogulu labe. Enebamo, naafa yane doweloguba, aalu Godene sulu mana nigili gagaiya ami seleba labe. Olifi i naafafea walea hano meloguba, Godehe Ene Asubane Noekene aalufea meyobafe. </char></note><char style="qt">aida eweda</char>, naafa yaalo aida eweda, <char style="qt">helefealune <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Gode amone olegia kalugaafia ado amone labe.</char> <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:9">2Sml 22.9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:3">Sng 97.3</ref></char></note>Inolo ulenohe aalu woba ufiyo adesenaga, aine mofeyofeafia de holobagasia, aine gisamo naba samodoyobafe. Abehe aalu woba ufiyo molofe amo, aubasu dufa olaeyobafe. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1Kin 17.1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 7:17-20">Kis 7.17-20</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 4:8">1Sml 4.8</ref></char></note>Inolo aida ewehe, Godene sulu mana saaba ofa selabia siba labe fogo amohe, hele sugamesialene anakiwi kaeyomo kiwigagalu aalufea dobu. Aufia, hano sunia ibigulu holobagamesi moloyomo, aalufea kiwigagalu dobu. Aufia, helefealu ami higinilu gi holobagamesi, fogo halagia aalu meyo hamefeguba, moloyomo, aalufea kiwigagalu dobu.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:21">Dan 7.21</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:17">MUU 12.17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:7">13.7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:8">17.8</ref></char>
    </note>Fogo aaluhe Godene sulu saaba dafelagoba selabia siba alolumo, saaba samodosi, kelebulu wolumo hele gogolu ulumaluda maleiya ami afasia, fela milifasia, ehe aaludai yobofia, aalu dufa dafogosia, dufa olaeyobafe. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:34">Lug 13.34</ref></char></note>Ausi, aine domalamo sidi bule amone eno kia ami hamagi ufiya miliyobafe. Sidi amo, ilihe samini aine Saminilomo <char style="w">imolane</char> ami uluba ufulubiyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sidi amo ilihe Yesuda </char><char style="fq" closed="false">imolane uluba ufuluiya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amone wimo, Yelusalame.</char></note> Sidi amone wimo, ninihe besiba selesiamo, wi nomo, <char style="w">Sodomo</char>, wi nomo, Isibiba sodo. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Hilia osoloafia, hilia haisi no amone aleba amimo, idele inolo misi nonoba bolo sunia amifiada, mosomu nonoba sunia amifiada, sulu nonoba sodo sunia amifiada, hele nonoba sunia amifiada, ili amohe aine domalamo babiyofia milibaiyobafe. Aufia, ilihe aine domalamo balimabusia kaeyobafe. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Auba molosimo, helefealu kakainabu ilihe aalumo isoba olaluba heafusia, gasa saafia, naiyo nabia, damene ine geleba ulu kegele sagalabia maiyobafe. Mau enebamo, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> aida amohe, helefealu idele inolo suniafea naga meba ado. Aulune, ilihe aalu olalu amone heneyobafe.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 37:5">Ese 37.5</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 37:10">10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 37:14">14</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, hilia osoloa alefasia haisi amo samodosimo, <char style="qt">bebea miliyone hame heelo Godefeafia aalufea adesimo, aalu amo degefasia, kalugaafia adeso.</char> Ausi, idele inolohe aalu amone bisigia, hidigisia bule sagiliba yaaso. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:11">2Kin 2.11</ref></char></note>Ausimo, aaluhe sulu uleno <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> aalufea eweguba wuaaba selesi dobeleso. “Aali iwi fela mila!” Ausi hamagi, aine gisa inolohe sidafia alebaibi, aalu amo, kene aleba fasefasia, hebene fela aaso. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:12">MUU 6.12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16.18</ref></char></note>Ausi, alebale fogo hamagi, heleli bule sigisi, sidi amone haisi daabuluba amone, haisi ulenomo woba dafeleso. Ausimo, alegaba saii domoba (7,000) idele inolomo, heleli sigife amohe daneba yaaso. Idele inolo aso siba dafalifemo, ili amo wobasubale koleba sagiliba yegilisia, hebenene Gode wi digiso.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 9:12">MUU 9.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, yeele aganebomo samodofia labe. Nafuluba, yeele osolo amo holobagaeyomo hagoalefe.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-s</para>
  <para style="s">Sulu dia ano domohe belo fuulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:18">Kis 15.18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 10:16">Sng 10.16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:44">Dan 2.44</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">7.14</ref></char>
    </note>Sulu dia ano domo amohe ene belomo fuusi, <char style="w">hebene</char> usu ami, sulu koleba eweguba selaba yaaso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 11:15" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:15">“Helefealu suniada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:15">kegele suniada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:15">amone luba adesia yasiyone,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:15">aga nine Saminilo Godefea ufulu labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:15">Nine Saminilo Ehe,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:15">Ene iminiba ufulu <char style="w">Keliso</char> galiba,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:15">kinine asefalu ailaiya ami asefasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:15">aga suniane yasilo aselesia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:15">sunia uluba adesia, alefalu labe-eee!”<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Aufia, guni inolo daabuluba aidafia biniba (24) Godene olegia ami, ine kinine asefalu ailalu saabia yoba kakainabu ili amo, ine olegia sauba fufunaloba ilogofia, Godene wi digisia, Efea eweguba seleso.<verse eid="REV 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />“Saminilo Gode-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:17">Labe amo, Ga koleba-aaa!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:17">Alolu amo, Ga koleba-aaa!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:17">Kiwigagaluda suniane wasolumo, Ga labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:17">Gahe Ge kiwigagalumo difasia, aga moloba dafelagofe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:17">Aufia, Ga-mo, Ge asefalu ailalu saabia yoba aselesia, yasilo adefe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:17">Aulune, ninihe Gafea heafusia, wisoba selesu-ooo!<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:5">Sng 110.5</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:5">Lom 2.5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:11-13">MUU 20.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:13">Sng 115.13</ref></char>
    </note>Helefealu mosomu ili amo koleba kanoba yaafia alebaibu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:18">Auluso, agamo Ge kanolumo holobagafe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:18">Aufia, daneba yaalu ilimo osolasia, fadaayo hiliamo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:18">aga holobagabu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:18">Aufia, Ge dabalu mololo amofea elebe nafulu meba yaeyo hiliamo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:18">aga adefe-eee!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 11:18" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:18">
    <char style="w">Saaba ofolo</char> ili amoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:18">
    <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Ge muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> ili amoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:18">aufia Ga sisa alebailo ili amoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:18">ili amomo, buleda, wedinoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:18">Ge dabalu mololo alebaisia, ine elebe dife-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:18">Aufia, helefealuda woba dafalilo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 11:18">ili amone woba dafaliyo hilia amo, aga holobagafe-eee!”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 9:4">Hib 9.4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 8:5">MUU 8.5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 15:5">15.5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:21">16.21</ref></char>
    </note>Guni inolo ili auba saaba samodosi, Godene <char style="w">sebele molo</char> hebene labemo ulufa sogoba ofeleso. Sogoba ofelesi, oloba huliale dabalu mololo amone bogose molo usu ami ufulumo, ulufaba besabeo. Ausi, yabagelesia, galamo galasia, hagana dowesia, heleli sigisi, hele kano badilu sodolo hugaso.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-e</para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Yonehe idodai, hausabe ayeeludai, abulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Momolelu kegele">Eloba bamesine momolelu kegele</char> bule uleno <char style="w">Hebene</char> lagi holobagaso. Momolelu kegele amo ewe. Ido uleno holobagaso. Ido amohe halo, ene fagulogulu, kaafia labi, aubemo ene emo sisa labeo. Aufia, sigabi huguluba, kaamo alolune momada kaalo amoguba, ene gunia gegefia labeo. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 4:10">Mai 4.10</ref></char></note>Ido amo faibe asulune, haseyo hagoalesi, bule nagasia, koleba yeeba adeso. <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7.7</ref></char></note>Auba ausimo, eloba bamesine momolelu kegele no, Hebene lagi holobagaso. Hausabe genelu aiyeelu, inolo ulenoda bolalegulu, holobagaso. Efea guni domobabiyo. Aufia, maide daabulubabiyo. Guni domoba amone saabia, kinine habuga ule uleba saligaba yaalubiyo. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:10">Dan 8.10</ref></char></note>Ene wafe amohe, anakiwine sigabi amone, haisi osoloa amone ulenomo, sawaba dibia, helefealu dafaliba ilogoso. Ido amo faibe seba disimo, hausabe amohe faibe dufa naiyo hamefia, ido amone mia yasifia labeo.<verse eid="REV 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:9">Sng 2.9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:15">MUU 19.15</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, ido amohe inolo faibe seba disi, nohe subobo amo alebale fafuba difasia, Gode labea lagi, Ene kini asefalu ailalu dobia ami ifoyo aaso. Faibe amone saaba, sulu eweguba solu dobu. <char style="qt">Ehe dufia helefealu idele inolo mosomu sunia, dofene sibi yasiba adoguba, aeyene kaidamo sefia ligia, kiwigaaba, yasifia luba miliyobafe.</char> <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Auba ausimo, ido amo fisaba abia, hele falaiya inoloda maleiya ami misiyo aaso. Hele falaiya inoloda maleiya ami, e hilia alegalu 1,260 auba uluba melesifia, Godehe hele uleno ido amone madeneba ufulubiyo.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JUD 1:9">Yud 1.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia hebene lagimo, ili yobosia belaguso. Maigoloda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maigolo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Godene sulu dia ano aleba ami yasiba ado uleno e.</char></note>, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> e galiba alebailoda, ili amohe hausabe aiyeelu amodai belaguba yoboso. Ausi, hausabeda, ene sulu dia anoda, ili amohe sabe belaguba obegeso. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="REV 12:8-9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.8-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Stt 3.1</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 3:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:18">Lug 10.18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31">22.31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:2">MUU 20.2</ref></char></note>Ili belagusiamo, hausabe amo kiwidale adesia, hebene lagi ili aselomo daba dafeleso. Ausi, ilihe eda, ene sulu dia anoda, helefealu saabia saidafaliba ilogoso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 12:8-9">Hausabe aiyeelu amo, samini waagi soiye alolu hamagane, amo e labe. Ene wimo, <char style="w">henane</char>. Wi nomo, <char style="w">Sedene</char>. Masega gegesia, helefealu idele inolo sunia heleba ulubia anomo, e.<verse eid="REV 12:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-s</para>
  <para style="s">Godene kiwigagalo ulufaba holobagafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:9-11">Jop 1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:1">Sek 3.1</ref></char>
    </note>Hausabe helefealu saabia saidafa ilogosi, na sulu uleno hebenefia koleba selesi dubulu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 12:10" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:10">“Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> obegeba diyone hilia amo aga holobagafe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:10">Ene kiwigagalo ulufaba aga holobagafe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:10">E Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo miliyone hilia amo aga adefe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:10">Aufia, <char style="w">Keliso</char> E wida solu kiwida ligia, aga yasilo adefe-eee!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 12:10" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:10">Maumo, Sulu Oloba Koweba Sodo ogo, saidafogolu labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:10">Nigilibada, yaidada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:10">ehe Godene olegia, nine damenedalifea sulu oloba koweba sodo-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:10">Auluso, agamo e saabia no labale-eee!<verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Nine damenedali, ilihe ine domala helefealu iwi nafulu misiyoba,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:11">auba koleba asigilale-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:11">Ili amo olaeyofealo kalugaeyone sagililale-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:11">Aubale-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:11">Godene sulu saaba dafelagolu amofea alefasiada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:11">
    <char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi edo">Dofene Sibi Edone</char> ibi amofea alefasiada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:11">ili amo kaamo alolu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:11">Auba kaamo adesia, ilihe Egedidilomo dufa dafogolu-ooo!<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:23">Ais 44.23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:13">49.13</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, Hebene, ga henema-aaa!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 12:12" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:12">Auluso, helefealuda, salu hanoda, aalifea yeele-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:12">Maumo, henanemo aali labea sugafia labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:12">Ehe yasiba miliyo fogomo abobo labeba hilisefe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 12:12">Aulune, e koleba kanofia labe-eee!”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="rem">z1col-e</para>
  <para style="s">Hausabehe ido aiba gasalabia aafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Hausabe amohe e helefealu saabia saidafogolububa eloba bisigia, ehe inolo faibeda seba dulu ido amone, aiba gasalabia aaso. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:25">Dan 7.25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:7">12.7</ref></char></note>Ido amo, hele falaiya inoloda maleiya ami, hele ene-ba madeneba ufuluiya ami, hauba dia malesine, uso bule amone awimo efea meso. Ausi, hamu osoloafia hamu haisi e ami uluba labi, soiyehe e babiyodoluale adeso. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Ido amo aasi, soiye amohe ene mofe gau fuuba dafogosia, hano bule anoguba abia ido amo gasiagusia, e muba dibia malesifia auso. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Auluso, helehe ido amo sagoba ofelesia, mofeyo sogaloguba, sogaba ofelesia, hano bule hausabe fuuba dafogoba alolu amo, e naba gulubaiso. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:7">MUU 11.7</ref></char></note>Auba ausimo, hausabe amohe ido amofea bule koleba kanosia, e afa abia, ido amone faibe noolodai yobosia belaguyone aaso. Godehe molomalu sulu nafuluba kuliba abia, Yesune sulu saaba dafelagolu fedoba sefia alebaibumo, ili amomo, ido amone faibili alebaibu. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Auba abiamo, hausabe e-mo salu hano galubumone saii saabia kalugaafia labeo.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Kelebulu wolu salu hano galubu amifia holobagabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 12:3">MUU 12.3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:3">17.3</ref>, <ref loc="REV 17:7-12">7-12</ref></char>
    </note>Hausabe salu hano galubumone saii saabia kalugaafia labi, kelebulu wolu uleno salu hano galulu amifia holobagasi na abulu. Efea guni domobabiyo. Aufia, maidemo daabulubabiyo. Maide daabuluba amone saabia, kinine habuga ule uleba saligaba waalelubiyo. Aufia, ene guni domoba amofea wi nokene nokeneba Gode gaidaboba selelu dobiyo. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:4-6">Dan 7.4-6</ref></char></note>Kelebulu wolu amo, busi aiyeelu, <char style="it">lebade</char>gulu besabeo. Auluso, ene emomo, kelebulu <char style="it">bea</char> amone emogulubiyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bea </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo, kelebulu bule kiwida labe. E gadisiamo, inolo yasoba dafalilo.</char></note> Aufia, ene mofemo, <char style="it"><char style="w">laeono</char></char> amone mofegulubiyo. Kelebulu wolu amohe yasiba uluba melesifia, hausabe ehe efea kiwigagalu meso. Aufia, ene kini asefalu ailalu saabia yoba mesesi, ene wabialelo wida solu amoda efea meso. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:8">MUU 17.8</ref></char></note>Kelebulu wolu amone guni uleno amo momonilu olaeyodolu besabeo. Auluso, momonilu amo waiso. Ausi, helefealu idele inolo suniahe amone momoleba bisigia, kelebulu wolu amone kuliba dedaleso. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Idele inolohe hausabefea guluguluso. Mau enebamo, ehe kelebulu wolu amofea wida solu kiwida melubiyo. Aufia, ilihe kelebulu amofeada gulugulusia, selesia, “Kelebulu ewegulu kolebamo, abe koleba miliyobafebi? Edai gisa disia, kaamo miliyobafemo, uleno male koleba.”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:8">Dan 7.8</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:36">11.36</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:2">MUU 11.2</ref></char>
    </note>Kelebulu wolu amohe, ene wida solu kiwida amo alefasia, bamabamasia, Godefea gaidaboba selaba adeso. Efea auba moloba melesine, fogo waagi gadefafia, efea aube daabuluba binibafia aida (42) meso. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Aube amo aleba ami, kelebulu wolu amohe Godefea gaidaboba selabasu melesi, fogo waagi gadefaso. Aufia, ehe Godene wifeada gaidaboba selesia, aufia Eda labea amofeada, <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi kakainabu ili sunia amofeada, gaidaboba seleso. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:7">MUU 11.7</ref></char></note>Aufia, kelebulu wolu amofea <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene idele inolo</char> galiba gisa disia, ili dufa dafogomesifia fogo waagi mefia gadefaso. Aufia, ehe mosomu suniada, misi nonoba bolo suniada, sulu nonoba sodo suniada, aufia hele nonoba suniada, yasimesine efea waagi fogo gadefafia, wida solu kiwigagalu meso.<verse eid="REV 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:28">Sng 69.28</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:8">MUU 17.8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:12">20.12</ref>, <ref loc="REV 20:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:27">21.27</ref></char>
    </note>Helefealu iwi kakainabu idele inolo sunia, ilihe kelebulu wolu amone wi wabialesia, efea guluguluyobafe. Auluso, idele inolo ine wi Miliyolu Miliyo Bugo selelu dobu, ili amomo, kelebulu wolu amofea guluguluyobafale. Miliyolu Miliyo Bugo amomo, <char style="w">Dofene Sibi Edo</char> amone dobu. Dofene Sibi Edo amo, Godehe helefealuda moloba dafelagoba maugaiyafia, dufa dasigalu labe.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Idele inolo konenida labe gilimo, sulu ewe nafuluba doma.<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 15:2">Jer 15.2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 43:11">43.11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:12">MUU 14.12</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">“Inolo uleno dofafia, dibolo maiyo iminiba ufulunaga, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 13:10">
    <char style="qt">amo e dibolo maiyobafe. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 13:10">
    <char style="qt">Inolo uleno helebesi dumesi iminiba ufulunaga, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 13:10">
    <char style="qt">amo helebesihe e dufelesi, olaeyobafe.” </char></para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10" />
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10">Aulugulu, Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo gilimo, kiwi sanefia afelesiale, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char> fedoba sefia melale.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelebulu wolu aganebo helefealufia holobagabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Ausi, nahe kelebulu wolu no helefealufia holobagaba lagosi, abulu. Kelebulu amohe maide kokomolu aida, <char style="w">Dofene Sibi Edo</char> amo gunia gaalo amoguba, ene gunia gaabiyo. Auluso, e hausabe aiyeelu amo sulu sodoguba seleso. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Kelebulu aganebo amohe, kelebulu wolu no, samini holobagalu amone wida solu kiwida sunia difasia, e amone wi alefasia dabalu moloso. Ausimo, ehe idele inolo helefealu kakainabumo, kelebulu wolu samini momonilu olaeyodolu wailu amofea gulugulumesi egedidiso. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mad 24.24</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:24-39">1Kin 18.24-39</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:20">MUU 19.20</ref></char></note>Auba ausiamo, ehe <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> eloba bamesi bule koleba waleba adeso. Idele inolone si saabia, ehe de <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> suga milesi moloso. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Kelebulu agele amone wi alefasia, eloba babiyone momolelu kegele waagi molomesine efea gadefasi, ehe idele inolo helefealu alebaibu amo gegesia sigiso. Ausimo, ehe idele inolofea kelebulu wolu agele amone mimisililumo molomaba seleso. Kelebulu wolu agele amo, samini helebesihe e momoniluso, aga waifia aso bebea labe amofea wabialesia wi digiba samesi auso.<verse eid="REV 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Mimisililu molofasiamo, kelebulu wolu aganebomohe, kelebulu wolu agele amone mimisililu mololu amofea hame heemesi fuuba dafogoso. Mimisililu amo sulu samesine auso. Ausi, helefealu idele inolohe kelebulu wolu agele amone mimisililufea gulugulusalenaga, amo ehe ili dufa danemaleyomo kiwida labeo. Mimisililu auba moloba homesine, kelebulu aganebofea waagi fogo meso. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:9-11">MUU 14.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:2">16.2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:4">20.4</ref></char></note>Aufia, ehe idele inolo sunia, buleda, wedinoda, elebeda ufuluda, elebeda ufulualeda, beega adoda, <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu mololoda</char>, ili amo suniafea egedidisia, noolofea ine sone inaloalo saabiada, me ine olegi saabiada, eloba bamesine imini homaleba samesi egedidiso. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Aulugulu, idele inolo abehe imini amo ine domalafea seleba ofelesi dulualenaga, ili amofea kegele elegeba dimabiyoba saeyobafe. Aufia, ili amofea kegele noolofea elegemabiyoba saeyobafe. Imini amomo, kelebulu wolune wi amone, me ene namba alegalo amone dobiyo.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Sulu na selesu ewe, nafuluba osolaba baafia asigima. Inolo abehe asigilo nafulu dobunaga, kelebulu wolu amone alegalumo osolaba babiyone nafuluba alegamale. Namba alegalumo, inolone namba. Ene namba ewe, 666.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Dofene Sibi Edone idele inolohe gasa hili olabolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Ausi, na saabia bisigia, bosolufalumo, <char style="w">Dofene Sibi Edo</char> amo Saiono galea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Saiono gale</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo Yelusalame sidi amone iminiba selefe. Enebamo, Yelusalame sidi amo Saiono galea ami labe.</char></note> ami yoba labi abulu. Edaimo, 144,000<note caller="†" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dawalolu inolo noolo eweguba hilisefe. Namba alegalu 144,000 amomo, mimisililune namba. Namba 12 amo ililiba samodolune alegalu namba iminife. Aufia, 12 saabia 12 alegafe amo, 144 amone alegafe. Aufia, 1,000 amomo, wasigalune namba. Aulugulu, 144,000 iwi selefe amo, namba wasigafia ililiba samodolu kolebaba iminife. (12 x 12,000 = 144,000). Amo idele inolo saludiale, alegaeyodoluale amone iminife. </char></note> idele inolo ilida, ami kalugagafia alebaibiyo. Idele inolo ili amone olegifeamo, Ene widai, Enaone widai, seleba waalelubiyo. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:15">MUU 1.15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:6">19.6</ref></char></note>Aufia, nahe gala wangi <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> saabi dubulu. Gala wangi amo, hano bule gulologuba, gulosia, hagana guduloguba, guduso. Aufia, gala wangi amo, gida wedinale galaba labi dobologuba, dobeleso. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:10">Ais 42.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:9">MUU 5.9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:4">7.4</ref></char></note>Aufia, idele inolo ili ewe, kini asefalu ailalu amone olegia, aufia bebeada labe biniba amone olegiada, guni inolo ine si saabiada, gasa hili uleno olabosia alebaibiyo. Inolo ulenohe gasa amo saeyone dedesi dawaloyobafale. Aubale. 144,000 helefealu iwi Yesuhe gasiba dafelagoba elegeba dulu, ili amosu gasa ewe saeyone dedesi dawaloyobafe. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Ili amomo, idodai ado manafealomo, ilihe ine meleba nuguma baalale. Ili amo, ido faisalo anale inolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ido faisalo anale inolo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba solu amone kiwimo, nini sulu kiwi osoloa alegasu. 1. Seale, domalafealomo, inolo amo ido ulenodai adale koleba. 2. Inolo amo, idodulufealomo, galagololu ado. 3. Asubanefealomo, e nonoba molosiale, Gode amofeasu gulugululo. Sulu kiwi osoloa amone hala koleba, Yone iminiba seleba ufulubi, nini babeafe. Auluso, amo hama, nini Godene olegia galagololu miliyo amo kiwi olaibo.</char></note> labe. Aufia, Dofene Sibi Edo Eda aafea ami, ilida E kuliba siba adomo, 144,000-mo ili amo labe. Godehe ili amo helefealu idele inolo mosomu sunia kakainabu aleba amifia elegeba dulumo, ili amo koleba. <char style="w">Sebe olaibo</char> Godefeadai, Dofene Sibi Edofeadai, ulu melumo, ili amo koleba. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Ili amo masega sulu gegeba sodale. Aufia, ilifea heleba daalu ulenoda, male koleba.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sulu dia ano osoloahe sulu saaba melu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Ausi, na bosolufalumo, sulu dia ano no anakiwi olea lagi, hauba dia siba labi abulu. Ausi, sulu dia ano amohe, sulu gi uleno sefia abia, idele inolo helefealu iwi kakainabu amofea waleyone aaso. Sulu e sebu amo nafulu alefalu dobu. E abiamo, hele nonoba sunia dobia amida, mosomu nonoba sunia dobia amida, sulu nonoba sunia sodo dobia amida, aufia misi nonoba sunia bolo labea amida, sulu gi amo sefia aaso. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />E koleba wuaasia, eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 14:7" />
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 14:7">“Gode Ene osolaeyo hiliamo holobagafe-eee!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 14:7">Aulugulu, gilihe E baaba sagilisia, Ene wi digiba saama-aaa!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 14:7">Anakiwida, helefealuda, salu hano galuluda, aufia hano suguloda, Ehe Ene moloba dafelagolu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 14:7">Aulugulu, gilihe E wabialesia, Ene wi digiba saama-aaa!”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 21:9">Ais 21.9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:7-8">Jer 51.7-8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:2">MUU 17.2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:2">18.2</ref>, <ref loc="REV 18:3">3</ref></char>
    </note>Sulu dia ano amone faisa, sulu dia ano no saabeo. Aganebo ewe selesia, “<char style="qt"><char style="w">Babilono</char> olaboba dedalelubu-ooo!</char> Sidi amo, susugu idogulu ligia, ene libo degefemone <char style="w">waini</char> hano kolelu amo, ehe ene gaabufeafia mosomu suniafea namenasia melobu-ooo! <char style="qt">Sidi bule amo, aga woba dafalubu-ooo!</char>”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 13:12-17">MUU 13.12-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, sulu dia ano aida amone faisa, osolo saabeo. E wuaaba selesia, “Idele inolo uleno abehe, kelebulu wolu amodai, ene mimisililu amodaifea, gulugulusia, ene olegifeada, me ene sonefeada, kelebulune iminimo dulu dobunaga, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">Ais 51.17</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 51:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:15-16">Jer 25.15-16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 75:8">Sng 75.8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Ese 38.22</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24">Stt 19.24</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:19">MUU 16.19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:10">20.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:8">21.8</ref></char></note>amo ehe Godene libo degefemo, waini hano nologuba, naiyobafe. Godehe ene gadilomo gaabu wasifasia, hanodai besisiale, balu namenasia efea meyobafe. Ausi, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> ili amone si saabiada, <char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi edo">Dofene Sibi Edone</char> si saabiada, inolo amo koleba dedai, abane salofadai, amone naga bule naiyobafe. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:10">Ais 34.10</ref></char></note>Ausi, ine naga naafeiya amifia, de kawa fela daabasu alefalu miliyobafe. Kelebulu wolu amofeada, ene mimisililu amofeada, gulugulusia, ene wimone imini ine domalafea seleba ufulu ili amomo, nigilibada, yaidada, halemane miliyobafale koleba.” Sulu dia ano osolomo, e auba seleso.<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 13:10">MUU 13.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, mana ewegulu moloyo hilia holobagasimo, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> gilimo, kiwi sanefia afelesiale melale. Godehe molomalelu sulu kuliba abia, aufia Yesufea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char> fedoba sefia melale.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Aufia, nahe <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> sulu uleno eweguba selesi dubulu. “Ga sulu eweguba seleba homa. ‘Agafia abiamo, idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> kulifia ligia, danefe ili amo, ine henelomo wasigaeyobafe.’ Sulu amo auba seleba homaba” seleso. Aufia, <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> Ehe sulu amone gegoaba eweguba seleso. “Seale, ine henelomo, seale wasigaeyobafe. Ilihe hogololu dabalu moloba aloiyamo afasia, halemane misiyone fogo ilifea meiya alebaibu. Enebamo, ine mana nafulu ili moloba yaalu amo, ili faisa milibaifia, ine galiba miliyobafe.”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helefealu sebe gegenelu suiyo hiliamo holobagabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, bosolufalumo, na kene hoolu uleno abulu. Kene saabia ami, uleno yoba saabeo. Ami yoba saabe amo, <char style="qt">E <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> koleba besabeo</char>. Ene gunia kaamo alolumone habuga golo mololumo, saligafia labeo. Aufia, ene sonemo, sebe suiyone helebesi koagelu minilu sefia labeo. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Ausi, sulu dia ano no Godene sebele moloafia holobagaso. Ehe kene saabiada Yoba Saabe Amofea koleba eweguba wuaaba seleso. “Helefealu iwimo, sebe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Iwimo sebe</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, idele inolo helefealu kakainabumone iminiba selefe.</char></note> sunia gegeneba yaabu amone suiyo fogo aga adefe. Aulune, Ga koleba, Ge helebesi ogo difasia, sebe gegelefia suba yaama.”<verse eid="REV 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Auba selesi, kene saabia Yoba Saabe Ewe, Ene helebesi koagelumo sefasia, helefealu iwi balualesia, sebe gegeneba yaalumo, gegelefia suba yaaso.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Ausi, sulu dia ano no, <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi, Godene sebele moloafia holobagaso. Eda sebe gegeleyone helebesi koagelu minilu seba labeo.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Ausi, sulu dia ano no, <char style="w" lemma="Soba meyone defene olabolu">soba meyone defene olaboiya</char> amifia holobagaso. Efea de yasiyone wida solu kiwigagalu labeo. Ehe sulu dia ano helebesi miniluda sefia labe amofea koleba wuaaso. E selesia, “Helefealu <char style="w">waini</char> sebe gegeneba yaalu dobugulu, gahe ge helebesi minilu ogo sefia, waini sebe, efolofea helelebia ami, gegelefia suba molama.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Ausi, sulu dia ano amo ehe, ene helebesi balualesia, helefealu waini sebe gegelefia suso. Aufia, ehe waini sebe amo molafasia, waini sebe fasilo abane gogolu bule amone usu dafaliba ilogoso. Waini fasilo gogolu amo Godene gadilo iminife. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:3">Ais 63.3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:15">MUU 19.15</ref></char></note>Ausi, ili sidi amone yala faisalo ami, waini sebe amo, emelasia fasiba yaasi, waini sebe fasiba yaeya amifia, ibi soaba abia, 300 kilomida<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">300 kilomida </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aafe fogo amo, Onobasulu heleafia abia Indonesia eloa goalo amoguba dobu. </char></note> amoguba aaso. Ibi soaba aafe amone galulumo, fela abia, <char style="w" lemma="Dofene hoso">dofene hosone</char> migilifofea eloso.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Sulu dia ano domobahe higinilu gi domoba sefia holobagalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Na <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi bisigiamo, na eloba bamesine kegele no abulu. Kegele amo <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> bule hidigiba besabeo. Sulu dia ano domoba, higinilu gi domoba afelesia dibia holobagagaso. Nahe iwi “afelesiaba” selesumo, mau ewe, higinilu gi domoba amomo, Godene gadilo amone liliba ofelesia eloyobafe. Higinilu amo samodofia labi, amone faisa, higinilu no miyobafale. <verse eid="REV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Ausi, na bosolufalumo, kegele uleno waiyo galulugulu ami dobi abulu. Hano amone fufuleloda male, galasigulu bisigia, de waiya nee fofageloguba neesi abulu. Waiyo galulu saabia amimo, idele inolo kalugagafia alebaibiyo. Idele inolo ili amomo, kelebulu wolu amofeada, ene mimisililu mololu amofeada, ene wimone namba alegalo amofeada, yobofasia kaamo alebaibiyo. Ili amo ami kalugagafia alebaibiyo. Godene gida sesaifia daiba ligia, gasa ami olabosia alebaibiyo. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:1">Kis 15.1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:4">Lo 32.4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 111:2">Sng 111.2</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 111:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:14">139.14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 145:17">145.17</ref></char></note>Gasa ili solu amomo, Godene dabalu mololo inolo <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesene</char> gasada selesia, <char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi edo">Dofene Sibi Edone</char> gasa amoda seleso. Ilihe gasa amone selesiamo, eweguba olaboso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 15:3" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="qt">“Gode <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilo-ooo</char>! </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="qt">Kiwigagaluda suniane wasolumo, </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="qt">Ga labe-eee! </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="qt">Dabalu ga mololu amo, </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="qt">bule momoleyodolu koleba </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="qt">mololubiyo-ooo! </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="qt">Helefealu mosomu idele inolo suniane </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="qt">kinimo, Ga labe-eee! </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="qt">Ge manamo isolu koleba alefasia, </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="qt">seale koleba labe-eee! </char><verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 10:6-7">Jer 10.6-7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:9">Sng 86.9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 98:2">98.2</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">Saminilo</char>,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="qt">Ga baaba sagililalemo, </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="qt">uleno labela-aaa? </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="qt">Aubada male koleba-ooo! </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="qt">Idele inolo suniahe </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="qt">Ga baaba sagilisia, </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="qt">Ge wi digiba sodo-ooo! </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="qt">Enebamo,</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="qt">Ga-su <char style="w">Noekene</char> labe-eee! </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="qt">Isolu mana Ga mololomo </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="qt">ulufa holobagasi abulugulu, </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="qt">helefealu idele inolo sunia </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="qt">Ge olegia milifasia,</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="qt">Gafea wabialeba saeyobafe-eee!</char>”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 38:21">Kis 38.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ilihe gasa auba olabofia, amone faisa amimo, na hebene usu lagi bisigiamo, Godene <char style="w">sebele molo</char> sogoba ufia labi abulu. Sebele molo amomo, Godene <char style="w">seele molo</char> labe. Oloba huliale dabalu amone molomalelu sulu daabuluba amo seele molo usu ami bogose selu dobiyo. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Moloa amifia, sulu dia ano domoba amohe, higinilu gi domoba amo sesaifia, holobagaso. Ili amo fagulo elalelu hoolu, nugumada male, saligafia, bulu golo mololumo ine hamesa agofa kakabiyo. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Ausi, bebeada labe biniba amone ulenohe, sulu dia ano domoba ilifeamo, golo moloba yaalu disi domobamo, meba yaaso. Disi amone usumo, alefalu miliyolu Gode amone gadilomo wasigaaba yaalubiyo. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:10-11">1Kin 8.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13-14">2Sto 5.13-14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:4">Ais 6.4</ref></char></note>Disi domobamo meba yaasi, Godene <char style="w">elalelu</char> amifiada, Ene kiwigagalu amifiada, de kawa holobagasia sebele moloa amimo, wasigaaba dafelesi, inolo uleno ami sugaeyodoluale adeso. Auba ufiasu ligia, sulu dia ano domoba amo, ine higinilu gi domoba amo ililisia samodosi, ami eloso.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Ilihe Godene gadilo wasigaalu disi domobamo guguba dafogolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Ausi, sulu uleno Godene sebele moloafia sulu dia ano domoba ilifea koleba eweguba selesi, na dubulu. “Godene gadilo disi domoba amofea fofalu waalebumo, gili difasia, helefealu saabia guguba dafogoyo mala!”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 9:10">Kis 9.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:12-17">MUU 13.12-17</ref></char>
    </note>Auba selesi, sulu dia ano agelehe, ene disimo dibia abia, helefealu saabia guguba dafogoso. Guguba dafogosi, idele inolo kelebulu wolu amone mimisililufea gulugulusia, amone imini inefea seleba waalebu ili amofea, aiye wolu kolelu kakainasia, naga bule diaba yaaso.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 7:17-21">Kis 7.17-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, sulu dia ano aganebohe, ene disimo salu hano galulu amofea guguba dafogoso. Guguba dafogosi, salu hano ami inolo olalune bole hugugulu adeso. Auba ausimo, hano usu ami bebeada kakainabumo sunia daneba yaaso.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Ausi, sulu dia ano osolohe, ene disimo hano dedalefea amida, hano sugulo dugulefea amida, guguba dafogoso. Guguba dafogosi, hano amo sunia ibisu adeso. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Auba ausimo, hanoda yasilo sulu dia ano amohe eweguba selesi, na dubulu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 16:5" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:5">“<char style="w">Noekene</char> kolebamo, Ga labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:5">Labe amo, Ga.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:5">Alolu amo, Ga.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:5">Isoba Osolalomo, Ga labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:5">Osolasia sabefemo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:5">Ga isolu koleba labe-eee!<verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Inolo ili ewehe,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:6">
    <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Ge idele inoloda</char>,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:6">Ge <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inoloda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:6">dufelesia, ine ibi sagaba yaalu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:6">Aulugulu, aga, Gode,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:6">Gahe ili osolasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:6">ilifea ibi amo namenesisia</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:6">sabe mefemo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:6">Ga isoba osolafe.”<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 19:9">Sng 19.9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 15:3">MUU 15.3</ref></char>
    </note>Auba selesi, sulu no <char style="w" lemma="Soba meyone defene olabolu">soba meyone defene olaboiya</char> amifia eweguba gegoaba selesi dubulu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 16:7" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:7">“Seale, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Gode,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:7">Kiwigagaluda suniane wasolumo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:7">Ga koleba labe!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:7">Ga mau fadaasiamo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:7">seale fadaalo.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:7">Ga osolasiamo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 16:7">isoba koleba osolalo.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Auba selesi, sulu dia ano binibohe, ene disimo halofea guguba dafogoso. Guguba dafogosi, Godehe halofea idele inolo haloba de waagi dasimesi gadefaso. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:20-21">MUU 9.20-21</ref></char></note>Idele inolomo halo amone nee halo kolelu alefasia, dasilesia waalesi, ilihe higinilu gi amo holobagagamesi kiwimo Godefea dobusia, Godene wi soaneba seleso. Ilihe nolofia <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besibale</char> ligia, Godene wi digiba selesale.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 10:22">Kis 10.22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:21-22">Ais 8.21-22</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, sulu dia ano bi amohe, ene disimo kelebulu wolu amone asefalu ailaiya ami guguba dafogoso. Guguba dafogosi, eda yasifia ada amo nigiligagalu gasiaguso. Idele inolo ami kakainalumo, naga disiamo, ine eanemo agasia nabaiso. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Ili naga dife amodai, aiye kakainafe amodai, bisigia, <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenene</char> Godefea soaneba seleso. Ili moloba alolumo, nolofia asigi besisale.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:15">Ais 11.15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, sulu dia ano kaabehe, ene disimo hano bule Yufuledisi amofea guguba dafogoso. Guguba dafogosi, halo holobagalofealofia kini milibaimesine eno madeneba ofelesia, hano amo usuba diso.<verse eid="REV 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Aufia, na ami sidafia labimo, asubane nugumalu, hagamegulu, osoloa holobagagasi abulu. Ili amo ulenomo, hausabe amone mofeyofiada, aufia ulenomo kelebulu wolu amone mofeyofiada, aufia ulenomo masega saaba ofolo amone mofeyofiada holobagagaso. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:19">MUU 19.19</ref></char></note>Asubane nugumalu osoloa amo <char style="w" lemma="Gamodo">gamodone</char> asubane ligia, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> eloba bamesi moloba labeo. Ili amohe helefealu suniane kini alebaibia ami abia, ine wafe dulu gagaiyoyone dedaleba yaaso. Kiwigagaluda suniane wasolu Gode amone hilia bule amo adesi, yoboyo amone ili osoloahe kini sunia wafe diaba yaaso.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:43-44">Mad 24.43-44</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:3">MUU 3.3</ref></char>
    </note>Yesu selesia, “Doma, Na inigiamo, fadilo inolo hidigiba dafa anoguba, Nada hidigiba dafa miyobasu. Aulugulu, abagudoa hanefia labi, yuaba bolosi, si kolafia, hanesiale, fagulo kakafia melale. Ausenaga, Na saabe hilia amo, ga henelo wasigaeyobafe.”<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 12:11">Sek 12.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, asubane nugumalu ili amohe kinine wafe dulu amo sunia <char style="w">Hibulu</char> sulubamo hele Amagedonoba soda ami gagaiyoba ofeleso.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Ausi, sulu dia ano domohe, ene disimo hisufea guguba dafogoso. Guguba dafogosi, sebele molosufia, Godene asefalu ailaiya amifia, sulu uleno koleba selesia, “Elofe-eee!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:5">MUU 4.5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 8:5">8.5</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, yabagelesia sigiba dedalesia, galamo galasia, hagana gudusia, heleli bule sigiso. Heleli amo bule koleba sigife amo, idele inolo helefealu maugaba aloiya amifia inigia, heleli bule amoguba sigisi abulualebiyo.<verse eid="REV 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 14:10">MUU 14.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, heleli bule sigilu amohe, sidi bulemo osoloaba, osolaba dafalisi, mosomu suniane sidi noolomoda woba dafaliso. Godehe sidi bule <char style="w" lemma="Babilono">Babilonone</char> mana mololumo asigi galisiale, efea <char style="w">waini</char> hano gaabu wasulu amo naba samodomaso. Waini hano amomo Godene libo degesia gadilo amone iminife. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:14">MUU 6.14</ref></char></note>Ausi, saidudu sunia fisaba dedalesi, hele gale ulenoda ami kalugaasi besabale. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:23-24">Kis 9.23-24</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">MUU 11.19</ref></char></note>Ausi, hele hugasia, hele kano badilu sodolo anakiwifia helefealu iwi hodobaisasia hugaso. Ausi, hele-kano badilu amone higinilu ule ulebamo kilo daabuluba bia (50) alegalu amoguba ufulubiyo. Hele-kano badilu amo idele inolo saabia hodobaisasimo, ili naga bule disia, Godefea soaneba seleso.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Susugu bule mololo ido amo fadaafasia, osolasia efea sabe melu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:12-13">Jer 51.12-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sulu dia ano domoba amohe disi domoba seba alolu amo uleno inigia, nafea eweguba seleso. “Hano wedinaleda sagaba yaafea sidi bule ami labe amo, susugu bule mololo idogulu labe. Ido amone fadaasia osolaeyomo, nahe gafea waleyobasubasi, ga mila. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:17">Ais 23.17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:7">Jer 51.7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:8">MUU 14.8</ref></char></note>Ido amomo, helefealune kini ilimo edai susugu molofia alebailu. Ene susugu manane <char style="w">waini</char> hano nafasia, helefealu kakainabu ili amo kagoalu alebailu.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 13:1">MUU 13.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane Noekenemohe</char> na kiwigaaba ofelesi, sulu dia anohe na lubia abia, hele falaiya inoloda maleiya ami aaso. Na hele ami ligia, bosolufalumo, ido uleno kelebulu genelu uleno saabia yoba saabi abulu. Kelebulu wolu amone domala saabiamo, soanelu sulu wedinale seleba waalelubiyo. Efeamo, guni domoba labeo. Guni amofeamo, maide daabuluba gagalubiyo. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:7">Jer 51.7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:16">MUU 18.16</ref></char></note>Ido amone fagulomo, hogaeadai, geneludai, mololu amone siligaba kaalubiyo. Aufia, fagulo e saligalu amo, <char style="w" lemma="Golo">goloda</char>, abane yogolelu saeyodolualeda, bageda, amodai <char style="w" lemma="Golo">momadalune</char>, fofagelu besabeo. Ehe gaabu golo mololu amo ene sone selubiyo. Gaabu usu amimo, ene susugu mololo mana amone kalemoludai, nugumaludai, wasiba ufia labeo. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Aufia, ene olegiamo, ene wi mugusilu eweguba seleba ufulubiyo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 17:5" />
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">
    <char style="sc">
      <char style="w">Babilono</char>, sidi bule koleba. </char></para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">
    <char style="sc">Susugu dilo idelene enae. </char></para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">
    <char style="sc">Helefealune kalemolu suniane enae. </char><verse eid="REV 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 18:24">MUU 18.24</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:2">19.2</ref></char>
    </note>Yesune sulu waleba alolu idele inolo ili amoda,<char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> ili amoda, yasoba danelu amone ibi nafasia, ido amo kagoalubiyo. Na ido amo bisigiamo, hidigifasia bule keleba hiliselu. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:1">MUU 13.1</ref></char></note>Auba ausimo, sulu dia anohe nafea eweguba seleso. “Ga enesi hidigiba hilisese? Kelebulu wolu guni domoba maide daabuluba amodai, ido kelebulu saabia yoba saabe amodai, amone mugusilu dobugulu, na gafea ulufaba fadaba saeyobasu. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12.1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:7">MUU 11.7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:7">13.7</ref></char></note>Kelebulu wolu ga besabe amo, samini e aloluso, aga e male. Alebale e hele gogolu bule ulumaluda male amifia holobagaeyobafe. Ausi, e woba dafiyofealo amolo lubia maiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:8">Helefealu kakainabu ili ine wi Miliyolu Miliyo Bugo ami helefealu maugaiya amifia seleba ufuluale, ili amo momoleba hidigiyobafe. Ilihe, kelebulu wolu amo samini aloluso, aga male, dufia e haiba holobagaeyobafeba bisigiane auyobafe.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Sulu na selesu ewe dawalofia, nafuluba osolafia asigima. Guni domoba amo, hele gale domoba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hele gale domoba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">solu amo Lomene sidimo iminiba solu. Enebamo, Lome sidimo hele gale domoba amone saabia diba ufulu.</char></note> amofea ido ami yoba aselo amone besiba solu. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Aufia, guni domoba amomo, kini domoba amone haiba iminife. Kini biamo ama hodobailubiyo. Aufia, kini ulenomo, aso uluba ligia yasifia labe. Aufia, uleno aso holobagabuale. Auluso, e holobagafia ligiamo, e fogo bilaledeno miliyo dobu. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Kelebulu wolu, samini alolumo, aga male amomo, kini aaiyo amone iminife. Kini domoba amone nomo, e ligia, woba dafiyofealo amolo maiyobafe.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7.7</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:24">24</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, maide daabuluba ga besabe amomo, kini daabuluba, heleda uluba ligia yasiyone, aso diaba yaaluale amone iminife. Auluso, ilihe kelebulu wolu amodai gegoafia, halosi fogo aoa ulehe ili kinigulu melesisia, hele yasimesi wida solu kiwida ilifea meba yaeyobafe. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Kini daabuluba amohe hilise ule ofasia, ine kiwigagaluda, ine wida soluda, kelebulu wolu amofea mesia, ilimo e sisa miliyobafe. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Ilihe <char style="w">Dofene Sibi Edo</char> amodai gisa bule disia, yobosia belaguyobafe. Auluso, yobofe amo Dofene Sibi Edo amohe, kaamo miliyobafe. Maumo, E <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">saminilone</char> Saminilo. Aufia, E kinine Kini. Aufia, Dofene Sibi Edohe wefasia, molobebelesia, Ene suluda fedoba sefia, kuliba dedaleba alolu ili amomo, E galiba miliyobafe.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Aufia, sulu dia anohe nafea saabia eweguba gegoaba seleso. “Susugu idoda yoba saabea ami hano sagaba yaasi, ga besabe ogomo, ewene iminife. Idele inolo misi nonoba bolo amoda, helefealu mosomu nonoba amoda, sulu nonoba sodo amoda, wamili nonoba kakainabu ili amoda, amone iminisia aufe. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:8">MUU 18.8</ref></char></note>Kelebulu wolu amodai, maide daabuluba amodai, ga besabe ogohe, susugu ido amofea habosia gogoloyobafe. Aulugulu, ilihe ido amone kegele dobumo sunia sagoba difasia, helefagulo sunia huba dafelesia, abagudoa gadefasia, ene huumo ili nabia, ene kiwimo de gameyobafe. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Ili auba moloyone asigilumo, Godehe ine asigifea hiliseba ufulu. Auba molosiamo, ilihe Godene daiyalu moloba yaeyobafe. Aulugulu, ili hilise ule adesia, ine yasiyone kiwigagalumo, kelebulu wolufea mefia ligia, ili auba mololabia dedaleba ligia, Godene sulu sunia moloba elosi, amo samodoyobafe. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Ido ga besabeo amo, sidi bule amone iminisia aufe. Sidi bule amohe, ami ene yasilone ailaiya yoba sigia, helefealune kini sunia yasifia labi, ilimo sidi amo sisa alebaibu.” Godene sulu dia ano nafea auba seleso.<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Babilono sidi bidiba dafulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Amone faisa amimo, sulu dia ano no, <char style="w">hebene</char> afasia, suga saabi abulu. Efea wida solu kiwigagaluda bule ligia, ene <char style="w">elalelu</char> nee amohe, helefealu neeba doweso. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:8">MUU 14.8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:21">Ais 13.21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 21:9">21.9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 34:11-14">34.11-14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:39">Jer 50.39</ref></char></note>E sulu koleba wuaaba selesia, eweguba seleso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 18:2" />
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:2">“<char style="qt"><char style="w">Babilono</char> bidiba dafulubu-ooo! </char></para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:2">
    <char style="qt">Sidi bule ogo, aga bidiba dafulubu-ooo! </char></para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:2">Agamo, sidi ogo, <char style="w" lemma="Gamodo">gamododa</char> kakainala, hele adefe-eee!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:2">Asubane nugumalu nonobada muguba asela, hele ami adefe-eee!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:2">Aufia, haga nugumaluda muguba kakainala, hele ami adefe-eee!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:2">Aufia, babiyo habolo kelebulu nugumalu amoda, ami muguba adaaba yaabu-ooo!<verse eid="REV 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q3">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Sidi ogo auba adefemo, mau ewe-eee!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:3">Mosomu sunia amohe, sidi ogone susugu mana amone <char style="w">waini</char> hano kolelu moloba alolubu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:3">Helefealune kini inolo ilihe ido ogodai susugu moloba alolubu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:3">Sidi ogohe yualalene mana wolu moloyoba hilisesia, kegele wedinale dibaiyesia, kegele nonoba elegeba molabasu labi, helefealune elegelo inolo ilihe sidi amofeafia mole bule diaba yaalubu-ooo!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 18:3" />
  <para style="m" vid="REV 18:3">Godene sulu dia ano auba wuaaba seleso.<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 48:20">Ais 48.20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:8">Jer 50.8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:6">51.6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:45">45</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:17">2Kld 6.17</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, nahe sulu goo no hebenefia selesi dubulu. Sulu goo eweguba seleso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 18:4" />
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:4">“Ne idele inolo gili, sidi ogo gadefia, fela milibaima-aaa!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:4">Gilihe ilidai gegoafia, ine mana <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> molofe amo osolaba dilosi-iii!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:4">Ilifea higinilu gi mefe amohe gilifeada melosi, milibaima-aaa!<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q3">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:20-21">Stt 18.20-21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:9">Jer 51.9</ref></char>
    </note>Maumo, wolu ili mololu amomo, adagiliba diba galabia fela abia, hebene gelu dobu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:5">Aufia, Godehe mana isoluale ili mololumo nafuluba hilisefiasu labe-eee!<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q3">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 137:8">Sng 137.8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:15">Jer 50.15</ref>, <ref loc="JER 50:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:6">2Des 1.6</ref></char>
    </note>Sidi ogo noolofea sabe meloguba, aubasu efeada sabe mema-aaa!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:6">E mololu obegeba mesiamo, hamagulu no saabia efea sagulaba mema-aaa!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:6">E noolofea naga mesiamo, naga kolelu gaabu wasulugulu, saabia aga efeada naga kolelu sagulaba sabe namenesi mema-aaa!<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q3">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 47:7-9">Ais 47.7-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ido ogohe ene wi digisia, ene domala heneba ofolaba adoguba, gilihe amone osolasia iminiba baafia, efeamo higiniludai, yagu nagalodai, imini hamagulu sabe efea mema-aaa!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:7">Enebamo, ehe ene meleba kaiiba hilisesiamo, eweguba selefe-eee!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 18:7" />
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">‘Na kuwini ido yoba solu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">Na ido ilisuluale-eee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">Aulugulu, na yeeyale-eee!’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q3">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 17:16">MUU 17.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, ido ogohe auba selesia asigilune, higinilu gi nonoba e labea hilia ule hamagahe holobagaeyobafemo, ewe-eee!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:8">Olaeyoda, yeeyoda, aufia mamia buleda, e labea holobagaeyobafe-eee!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:8">Dehe e sunia naiyobafe-eee!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:8">Enebamo, Gode <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> ido amoda fadaasia osolalumo, kiwida koleba labe-eee!<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:17">Ese 26.17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:30-35">27.30-35</ref></char>
    </note>Helefealune kini noolohe ido amodai susugu moloba ligia, ine domalada heneba ofolaba ligia alebailumo, ilihe e de nabia kawa felafe amo bisigia, ido amo olafesia yagunagasia, e saabia yegiliyobafe. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Ilihe ido amo naga bule dife amone bisigia sagilisia, ili hago yoba alebaifia ligia, saaba suliiba yegilisiamo eweguba saeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 18:10" />
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:10">‘Yeele! Yeele! Sidi bule-eee!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:10">Yeele-eee! Babilono-ooo, ga sidi kiwigagaluda alolu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:10">Gafea sabeba obegesi, halosi aoa ule hamagahe, ga bidiba dafelefe-eee!’<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 27:36">Ese 27.36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kini auba saaba suliiba yegiliba alebaibi, helefealune kegele elegelo inolo ili amomo, Babilono amohe kegele nonoba saabia no elegeba diyalebusia, amone saaba suliisia yegiliyobafe. <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:12-13">Ese 27.12-13</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 27:22">22</ref></char></note>Sidi ami ilihe kegele elegeba alolumo ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 18:12" />
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:12">
    <char style="w">Goloda</char>,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:12">Silifada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:12">Abane yogolelu saeyodoluale amoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:12">Bageda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:12">Fagulo nenafolo,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="REV 18:12">nomo gegenelu,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="REV 18:12">nomo hogalegulu,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="REV 18:12">nomo sanelu abenelu,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="REV 18:12">amoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:12">Isamenada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:12">Dofene elefene maide mololu kegele nonoba amoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:12">Ile i mololu kegeleda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:12">
    <char style="w">Bolonoso</char> mololu kegeleda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:12">Aeyene mololu kegeleda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:12">Abane hoolu mololu kegele nonoba amoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:12">Kegele amogulu sunia elegeba ado alolu.<verse eid="REV 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />Aufia, kegele noolo elegeba alolu amoda, ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 18:13" />
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:13">Nenalebalu nafulu kegele amoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:13">Kasineda nafulu dobolo kegele amoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:13">Waini hanoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:13">
    <char style="w" lemma="Olifi">Olifine</char> waleada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:13">
    <char style="w" lemma="Widi">Widida</char>,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:13">Falawada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:13">Dofene keaoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:13">
    <char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi">Dofene sibida</char>,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:13">
    <char style="w" lemma="Dofene hoso">Dofene hosoda</char>,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:13">Dofene hosone i fofolalu dia anoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:13">Inolone domalada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:13">Inoloda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 18:13">Kegele amogulu, Babilono amimo elegeba ado alolu.<verse eid="REV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Elegelo inolo ilihe sulu eweguba saaba suliiba saeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 18:14" />
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:14">‘Yeele-eee! Sebe ga dibaiyeba hiliselu ogo, sunia ga gadifia, hago dedalebu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:14">Beleme nafulune nafulu amodai, momada nafulune nafulu amodai, aga sunia asigileba samodolubu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:14">Saabia no babiyobafale-eee!’<verse eid="REV 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 27:31">Ese 27.31</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 27:36">36</ref></char>
    </note>Elegelo inolo ilihe mole wedinale sidi amofea dilo. Aulune, ilihe sidi amo naga wolu difemo babiyo sagiliyobafe. Sidi amo bidiba dafuluiya amifia, hago alebaifia, ili yagunagafia, eweguba selaba ligia, saaba suliiba yegiliyobafe.<verse eid="REV 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q3">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 17:4">MUU 17.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>‘Yeele-eee! Yeele-eee! Babilono sidi hagolu bule-eee!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:16">Saminimo, ga fagulo nenafolo, nomo gegenelu, nomo hogalegulu, nonoba kaafia alolu-ooo!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:16">Ge domalafeamo <char style="w" lemma="Golo">goloda</char>, abane yogolelu saeyodoluale helebe naiya mololumoda, bageda <char style="w" lemma="Golo">momadaba</char> kakafia alolu-ooo!<verse eid="REV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q3">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:14">Ais 23.14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:27-29">Ese 27.27-29</ref></char>
    </note>Halosi aoa ule hamagahe, ge beleme sunia koleba woba dafulubu-ooo!’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 18:17" />
  <para style="m" vid="REV 18:17">Ili auba yegilisi, hano sibida selo inolo suniada, hano sibida asefia hele nolobalo dedalelo idele inolo ili suniada, aufia hano sibine dabalu mololo ili suniada, aufia salu hano galulu amone dabalu molosia moleda dilo ili suniada, ili amo sunia Babilono bidiba dafuluiya amifia, hago alebaifia, sidafia miliyobafe. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:32">Ese 27.32</ref></char></note>Aufia, ilihe e de naafemo sidafia ligia, eweguba wuaaba saeyobafe, ‘Yeele! Sidi bule aiyeelu ewegulu no wagi dobubi? Eee, amogulu no malebu-ooo!’ <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Aufia, ilihe ine olegia dose heeba yaasia, yagunagafia, eweguba selaba ligia, saaba suliiba yegiliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 18:19" />
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:19">‘Yeele-eee! Yeele-eee!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:19">Sidi aiyeelu bule-eee!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:19">Ge beleme kegele sesaifia dedalesiamo, hano sibida enao sunia elebe bule diaba yaalubu-uuu!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:19">Halosi aoa ule hamagahe, ga koleba woba dafulubu-uuu!’ ”<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:23">Ais 44.23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Lo 32.43</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:48">Jer 51.48</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, sulu goo hebenefia eweguba seleso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 18:20" />
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:20">“Sidi amo woba dafulu dobi bisigia, hebene, ga nokene henema-aaa!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:20">
    <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> gilida, sidi amofea henema-aaa!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:20">Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibaisi daalu</char> gilida, henema-aaa!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:20">Aufia, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> gilida, henema-aaa!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:20">Maumo, sidi amohe gilifea wolu mololu amone fadaasia, Godehe isosia, sidi amo sefia, sabe obegeba mefe-eee!”<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:63-64">Jer 51.63-64</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:21">Ese 26.21</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, sulu dia ano kiwida ulenohe, abane baliama yadulu uleno difasia, salu hano galulu usu saidafogosia, selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 18:21" />
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:21">“Abane ewe koleba saidafogosuguba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:21">Babilono sidi bulemo aubasu saidafagoyobafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:21">Ausi, ulenohe ogo saabia haiba no babiyobafale.<verse eid="REV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 24:8">Ais 24.8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:13">Ese 26.13</ref></char>
    </note>Auba aulugulu, Babilono sidi ga, doma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:22">Gida galasi dobolomoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:22">gasa olabosi gala dobolomoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:22">salele galasi dobolomoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:22">sulu feeba galasi dobolomoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:22">ge yala usu ami, saabia no dobolaba yaeyobafale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:22">Ge yala usu ami, dabalu mololo idele inolo saabia no babiyobafale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:22">Widi sausia, abane gala dafelefemo saabia no holobagasi dubiyobafale.<verse eid="REV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:34">Jer 7.34</ref>; <ref loc="JER 16:9">16.9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:10">25.10</ref></char>
    </note>Naafane nee amo ge yala usu ami saabia no neeyobafale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:23">Ausi, ge yala usu ami, inolohe ido disia saabia no heneyobafale.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 18:23" />
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:23">Mau enebamo, mana ga mololumone gafea auba sabe meyobafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:23">Mana ga mololumo ewe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:23">Ga gone mulumulo moloba alolu amofea alefasia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:23">helefealu mosomu sunia heleba enoale uluba dia dedalelubiyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:23">Ausimo, auba mololu amofea alefasia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:23">ge elegelo inolo ilimo, helefealu iwi olaibo alebaisia, yasilo adaaba yaalubiyo.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:49">Jer 51.49</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:6">MUU 17.6</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, saaba ofolo ine ibida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:24">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo ine ibida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:24">seale, yasoba daneba yaalu idele inolo suniane ibi amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:24">ge yala usu ami dobi baaba golelubiyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:24">Aulugulu, aga gafea auba ausia sabe obegefe.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="rem">z1col-s</para>
  <para style="s">Babilono woba dafelesi, idele inolohe Godefea heafuba henelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Amone faisa, nahe <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi, gasa olaboba yaasi dubulu. Idele inolo wamili wedinale gasa olabosia, mofe goo wedinale sodoguba eweguba seleso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 19:1" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:1">“<char style="sls">Haleluya!</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Haleluya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amone kiwi sisamo, Saminilone wi digimaba selesia sodo. </char></note></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:1">Nine Saminilone wi digima-aaa!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:1">Nine Gode ewehe, nini <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> obegeba dulu-uuu!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:1">E <char style="w">elalelu</char> ligia, kiwigagaluda labe-eee!<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Lo 32.43</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:10">MUU 6.10</ref></char>
    </note>Enebamo, E osolasiamo, mau sealeba fadaalo-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:2">Ehe uleno sesia, osolaba dafelesiamo, isoba osolaba dafalilo-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:2">Enebamo, Ehe susugu bule mololo ido amo fadaasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:2">mololuba selesia, sefia osolalu-uuu!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:2">Ido amone susugu mana mololo amohe helefealu idele inoloda seseafia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:2">luba dia abia woba dafulumo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:2">Gode, Ehe ido amo sefia, osolafia labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:2">Godehe Ene dabalu moloba yaalo amone ibi,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:2">ido amofea fadaafia, sabeba obegelu-ooo!”<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Auba gasa saafia, ilihe saabia no gasa eweguba olaboba yaaso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 19:3" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:3">“<char style="sls">Haleluya!</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:3">Nine Saminilone wi digima-aaa!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:3">Babilono de moloiya amifia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:3">kawa fela daabasu alefalu miliyobafe-eee!”<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Ausi, guni inolo daabuluba aidafia biniba amoda, aufia bebeada labe biniba amoda, sauba hanefia, Gode, Ene asefalu ailalu saabia yoba saabe amone wi digiba selesia, eweguba seleso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 19:4" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:4">“Seale koleba auba auyobafe!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:4">Saminilone wi digima-aaa!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:4">
    <char style="sls">
      <char style="w">Amen</char>! Haleluya!</char>”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Aufia, asefalu ailaiya amifia sulu goo uleno saaba dafelagosia eweguba seleso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 19:5" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:5">“Gode baaba sagilisia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:5">E sisa alebaifia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:5">Ene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo idele inolo</char> gili sunia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:5">buleda, wedinoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:5">nine Godene wi digiba saama-aaa!”<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dofene Sibi Edone ido ifosia gasa olabosia selefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 14:2">MUU 14.2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, na dobelesufalumo, gasa no selaba yaasi dubulu. Idele inolo wamili wedinale gasa olabosia, mofe goo wedinale sodoguba seleso. Ili gasa olabofe amone gala amo, hano fasa gulologuba gulosia, hagana bule guduloguba guduso. Gasa olabofe amo ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 19:6" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:6">“<char style="sls">Haleluya-aaa!</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:6">Nine Gode, E <char style="w">Saminilo</char> labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:6">E kiwigagaluda suniane wasolu labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:6">Ehe helefealu idele inolo sunia uluba ligia, yasifia labe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:6">Aulune, ninihe Ene wi digisu-uuu!<verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:10">Ais 61.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:2">MUU 21.2</ref></char>
    </note>Agamo nini henesia, Efea heafusia, ibasia, aulo uluma-aaa!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:7">Ene wi wabialema-aaa!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:7">Mau enebamo, <char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi edo">Dofene Sibi Edone</char> ido ifoyomo, ama saabe-eee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:7">Aufia, Efea saaba melu ido<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dofene Sibi Edofea saaba melu ido </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amomo, sigidubulu idele inolo iminife.</char></note> amo momadaba dibia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:7">ene madenefia labe-eee!<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Fagulo nenafolo, hoolu fofagelu, galagololu amo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:8">efea kaamesi mefia labe-eee!”</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:8">Fagulo nenafolo hoolu amomo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:8">
    <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolone</char> isolu mana mololu amo-ooo!<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:2-3">Mad 22.2-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Na amone dobolaba labimo, sulu dia anohe nafea eweguba seleso. “Sulu ewene seleba homa. ‘Dofene Sibi Edone idoda ifofea ami, naiyo naiyone milesi saaba sigilu ili amo, ine henelo wasigaabu.’ ” Aufia, sulu dia anohe sulu amofea gegoaba selesia, “Sulu na solu ewe, Godene sulu seale eleda labe.” <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:25-26">HD 10.25-26</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:8-9">MUU 22.8-9</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, na sulu dia anofea guluguluyone, ene emo sisa sauba hanelu. Auluso, e nafea selesia, “Aa, ga auba molomabu. Nada, gadai ua dabalu mololo lolu. Aufia, Yesune suluda fedoba sefia alebaibu, gelewodalida, ganodalida, na ilidaida, ua dabalu mololo lolu. Aulugulu, nafea gulugulumabiyo. Gode ulefeasu guluguluba memale.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:10">Yesune sulu amohe, inolone asubanefea sulu saaba ofa samesi, asigi degeba ofolo.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-e</para>
  <para style="s">Yonehe Yesu dofene hoso hoolu saabia yoba saabi abulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 1:5">MUU 1.5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:2">6.2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:13">Sng 96.13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:4">Ais 11.4</ref></char>
    </note>Na <char style="w">hebene</char> sogoba dobi bosolufalumo, <char style="w">dofene hoso</char> hoolu uleno kalugaafia labi abulu. Dofene hoso hoolu saabia yoba saabe amone wimo, ewe. Fedoba Selo. Aufia Ene wi nomo, Seale Sodo. Mana isolusu kuliba abia, Ehe fadaasia osolalo. Aufia, gisadai yobosiamo, Ehe mana isolusu kuliba abia, belagulo. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:6">Dan 10.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:14">MUU 1.14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:17">2.17</ref></char></note>Aufia, Ene simo, de waiya neegulu besabeo. Aufia, Ene gunia amimo, kinine habuga wedinalemo kakafia labeo. Ene domalafea wi ule seleba ufulubiyo. Wi amo, uleno asigibualeso, Ene Elebisu asigibu. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:1-3">Ais 63.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:1">Yon 1.1</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:14">14</ref></char></note>E fagulo selale ibifea gelu amone<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Fagulo selale ibifea gelu amone </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu imolane olalu amone iminife.</char></note> siligaba kaalubiyo. Aufia, Ene wi selesiamo, Godene Suluba sodo. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Aufia, hebenene yobolo ilihe E kuliba dedaleba adeso. Ili amomo, fagulo nenafolo hoolu galagololu kakafia, dofene hoso hoholu wedinale saabia asefia, dedaleba adeso. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Sng 2.9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:16">MUU 1.16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:20">14.20</ref></char></note>Ausi, inolo amone mofeyofea helebesi minilu uleno holobagafia labeo. Helebesi amohe, helefealu mosomu idele inolo momagiba yaeyone sefia labeo. <char style="qt">Ehe helefealu idele inolo mosomu sunia, dofene sibi yasifia uluba adoguba, aeyene kaidamo sefia ligia, kiwigaaba, yasifia luba miliyobafe.</char> Ehe <char style="w">waini</char> fasilo gogolu usu, waini sebe emelasia fasiyobafe. Waini fasilo gogolu amomo, kiwigagaluda suniane wasolumo Godene libo degesia gadilo iminife. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:14">MUU 17.14</ref></char></note>Ene fagulo selale amofeada, Ene feelefeada, wi uleno eweguba seleba ufulubiyo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 19:16" />
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 19:16">
    <char style="sc">Kini suniane Kini, </char></para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 19:16">
    <char style="sc">Saminilo suniane Saminilo.</char> <figure style="fig" alt="Rider on white horse" file="66_Re_19_03_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="19.11-16">Inolo uleno dofene hoso hoolu saabia asefia belaguyo aafe.</figure><verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe kelebulu woluda, masega saaba ofoloda, seba sugasia, kaamo alolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 39:17-20">Ese 39.17-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, na bosolufalumo, sulu dia ano uleno halo saabia kalugaafia labi abulu. E ami ligia, haga anakiwi hauba dia sibaisafe amo suniafea wuaaba selesia, eweguba seleso. “Godehe naiyo bule madenefea iwi naiyone, gili gagaiyoyone milibaima-aaa! <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />Guni inolone huuda, aufia ibolo selu inolone huuda, inolo kiwidane huuda, <char style="w" lemma="Dofene hoso">dofene hosone</char> huuda, inolo dofene hoso saabia asefia dedalelo amone huuda, inolo widane huuda, inolo widalene huuda, bulene huuda, wedinone huuda, helefealu idele inolo ine huuda sunia, gili nabaiyone milibaima-aaa!” Sulu dia anohe, haga ilifea auba seleso.<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Auba selesi, na bosolufalumo, kelebulu woluda, helefealune kini ilida, aufia ine yobolo inoloda, ili amo gagaiyofia, hoso hoolu saabia Yoba Sabe Amodaida, Ene yobolo inolodaida, belaguyone gagaiyofia alebaibi abulu. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:12-17">MUU 13.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:10">20.10</ref></char></note>Ili auba gagaiyofia alebaibi, kelebulu wolu amo seba sugaso. Masega saaba ofolo eda, aalifaba seba sugaso. Saaba ofolo amo ehe, kelebulune wi alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Momolelu kegele">eloba bamesine momolelu kegele</char> mololu amofea alefasia, idele inolo gegeba adobiyo. Kelebulu wolu ene imini waalelu ilida, amone mimisililufea gulugululu ilida, idele inolo ili amo, ehe gegeba adobiyo. Kelebulu woludai, masega saaba ofolodai, aalu seba sugafia, aso bebea saabe waaga, waiyo usu, salofa de waiyaba labea ami saidafogoso. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Aufasia, dofene hoso saabiada Yoba Saabe Amone mofeyohe, helebesi selale holobagalu amohe, kelebulu wolu amone yobolo inolo sunia yasoba dafaliso. Auba yasoba dafaliba labi, haga ili amo sunia milibaifia, yobolo inolone huu amo kubaleba nabaiso.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Hamu daosene ule ami Sedene dofafia seba asulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 9:1">MUU 9.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, sulu dia ano uleno <char style="w">hebene</char> afasia, suga saabi abulu. Ene sonemo, hele gogolu ulumaluda male, amone giimo sefia saabeo. Aufia, ehe seini buleda selubiyo. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Stt 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:9">MUU 12.9</ref></char></note>E inigia, hausabe amo koleba sefia, seini dofaba ofeleso. Hausabe amomo, Soiye wolu amo, samini waagifia alolu hamagane, ene wimo <char style="w">Sedene</char>, <char style="w">henane</char> amo e, koleba. Aufia, sulu dia anohe e seini dofafiamo, hamu saii ule (1,000) amoguba melesi dofaba ofeleso. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Aufia, sulu dia anohe e-mo seini auba dofafia, hele gogolu ulumaluda male ami saidafogoso. Saidafogofasia, ehe hele gogolu amo koleba kaaba dafasia, nibuba ofeleso. Ausi, sedene ehe, helefealu idele inolo saabia no gegemesiale hamu saii ule (1,000) ami auba dofaba ufia ligia, misiyo dobu. Aufia, hamu saii ule elosi, e sububa dafogosi, fogo wedino e waagi siba melesi, gadefalu dobu.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7.9</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:22">22</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:2">1Kld 6.2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:17">MUU 13.17</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, na bosolufalumo, asefalu ailalu noolomo waalebi abulu. Asefalu ailalu amo saabiada kakainabu ili amofea Godehe dabalu mesiamo, idele inolo fadaasia osolamesine meso. Aufia, nahe bisigia, idele inolo noolo alebaibi abulu. Yesune suluda fedoba sefia, Godene sulu manada waleba alolune, gifogoloda gegeleba dafalilu, ili amo ami alebaibiyo. Ili amo kelebulu wolune imini ine olegifeada, me ine sonefeada waaleluale ligia, kelebulu woludai, ene mimisililudai, amofea gulugululalebiyo. Idele inolo ili amone haiba bebea alebaifia, hamu saii ule, <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisodai</char> ua kini adesia, uluba ligia yasiba adaaba yaaso.<verse eid="REV 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="REV 20:5-6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.5-6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 1:6">MUU 1.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ili ewemo bebea melesine degeba ifolu amo, fogo agele labe. Fogo agele degeba ifoyobafe ili amone henelo wasigasia, ili Godene <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> mosomu koleba miliyobafe. Olalo aganebomone kiwigagalu amohe ili diyobafale. Aubale. Ili amo Godedai Kelisodaine <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> miliyobafe. Aufia, ili amo Kelisodai kini alebaifia ligia, hamu saii ule uluba ligia, yasiyobafe. Hamu saii amone elosi, fogo ami, idele inolo daneba yaalu aso noolomo, <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba</char> ifoyobafe.<verse eid="REV 20:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sedenemo de labea saidafogoyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Hamu saii ule amo elosi, hele gogolu ulumaluda male amo sogoba ofelesi, <char style="w">Sedene</char> dibolo labemo sububa dafelagoyobafe. <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:2">Ese 38.2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 38:9">9</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 38:15-16">15-16</ref></char></note>E sububa dafelagosi, abia, helefealu mosomu hele kulia biniba aleba ami kakainabu idele inolo gegesiamo, ili ene yobolo alebaimesi gagaiyoba ufiyobafe. Yobolo mosomu amo ine wimo, ilihe Gogodai, Magogodaiba sodo. Aufia, yobolo inolo alegalumo, hano saiigulu miliyobafe.<verse eid="REV 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 1:10">2Kin 1.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, ili milibaisiamo, fuluba inigia, helefealu suniane fuba milibaiyobafe. Auba milibaifia, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> isola kakainabia amida, sidi Godehe hamesebu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sidi Godehe hamesebu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, Yelusalameba selesia aufe.</char></note> amoda, amaleba galiyobafe. Auba amaleba galifia alebaibi, bosolufalumo, <char style="w">hebene</char> lagifia de kolelu suga inigia, ili amo naba samodoyobafe. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 11:6">Sng 11.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:20">MUU 19.20</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:8">21.8</ref></char></note>Ausi, <char style="w">henane</char> ilida gegeba adomo, sefia, waiyo usu, salofa de waiyaba labea ami saidafogoyobafe. Kelebulu wolu amodai, masega saaba ofolo amodai saidafogoiya ami, eda ami dafogoyobafe. Ili osoloa amo waiyo usu ami ligia, yaidada, nigilibada, naga bule nabasu ligia, alefalu miliyobafe.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo daneba yaalumo Yesuhe osolaeyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Ausi, na bosolufalumo, kini asefalu ailalu hoolu bule uleno dobi abulu. Amida Yoba Saabe amo, na abulu. Ene olegi bisigia, helefealuda, anakiwida, fisaba abia asigileso. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9-10">Dan 7.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:31-46">Mad 25.31-46</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:31">HD 17.31</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:10">2Kld 5.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:8">MUU 13.8</ref></char></note>Ausi, daneba yaalu idele inolo, buleda, wedinoda, sunia, kinine asefalu ailalu amone olegia kalugagafia alebaibiyo. Ausi, bugo fisigaba waaleso. Daneba yaalu ili mana moloba alolumo bugo amo seleba waalelubiyo. Selelu amone beaba ligia, osolaba yaaso. Bugo amo fisigaba waalefia labi, Miliyolu Miliyo Bugo amoda fisigaba ofeleso. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:6">Lom 2.6</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:17">1Fid 1.17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:23">MUU 2.23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:12">22.12</ref></char></note>Idele inolo salu hano galulu usu gifiaba danelumone domala ulubaisasi, abuluale amo, salu hano amohe fogo ami, ili obegeba meba yaasi, ili ami kalugagabiyo. Ausi, Olalo amoda, Daneba Yaalu Yasiba Ada amoda, daneba yaalu idele inolo aaluhe sesaifia adomo, fogo hamagi obegeba meba yaasi, ilida ami kalugagabiyo. Ami kalugagafia alebaibi, ine mololu mana amo alefasia, elebi elebiba osolaba yaaso.<verse eid="REV 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Aufasia, Olalodai, Daneba Yaalu Yasiba Adadai, waiyo usu, de waiyaba labea ami saidafogoso. De waiya waiyo amo, aganebo olalo dobu. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Aufia, Miliyolu Miliyo Bugo usu inolo ulenone wi seleluale dobi besenaga, amo e de waiya waiyo usu ami saidafogoso.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Hebene hagaeadai, helefealu hagaeadai, holobagalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:17">Ais 65.17</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:13">2Fid 3.13</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, na bosolufalumo, <char style="qt"><char style="w">hebene</char> hilida, helefealu hilida,</char> dobi abulu. Maumo, hebene amakelelumoda, helefealu amakelelumoda, asigileba yaalubiyo. Salu hano galulu amoda malebiyo.<verse eid="REV 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:1">Ais 52.1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:10">61.10</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:16">Hib 11.16</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:22">12.22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:12">MUU 3.12</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, na bosolufalumo, sidi <char style="w">noekene</char>, Yelusalame hili amo, hebene lagi Godefeafia huga saabi abulu. Ene momada nafulu dulumo, idohe ene inolofea ifoyo maiyone ligia, yogolelu benabiye asigulubiyo. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:11-12">Wkp 26.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Ese 37.27</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:10">Sek 2.10</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2Kld 6.16</ref></char></note>Ausi, nahe sulu goo uleno kinine asefalu ailaiya amifia eweguba wuaaba selesi dubulu. “Bama! Godeda asela amo, aga idele inolo aleba ami adefe. E-mo idele inolo aleba ami misiyobafe. Aufia ilimo, Ene mosomu miliyobafe. Aufia, Gode Ene E-mo ine Gode ligia, ili galiba misiyobafe.<verse eid="REV 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 25:8">Ais 25.8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:10">35.10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:19">65.19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:17">MUU 7.17</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">Ehe ine si hano miliba alolumo, sunia heeba dafaliyobafe. Aufia, idele inolo haiba saabia no daneyobafale.</char> Aufia, ili ine libo higinifia, saabia no yagunagaba yegiliyobafale. Aufia, haiba saabia no naga diyobafale. Enebamo, amakelelu kegelemo, sunia asigileba yaafia miliyobafe.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 5:17">2Kld 5.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, kinine asefalu ailalu saabia Yoba Saabe Amo, E selesia, “Bama, Nahe kegele sunia hili molosu.” Aufia, E selesia, “Ewe seleba homa. Maumo, sulu ewe seale eleda koleba. Inolo suniahe, sulu ewefea seale koleba asigi ule ufiyodolu dobu.”<verse eid="REV 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:1">Ais 55.1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:13">Jer 2.13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:37">Yon 7.37</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:8">MUU 1.8</ref>, <ref loc="REV 1:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:17">22.17</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, E gegoaba nafea selesia, “Ne sulu solu sunia moloba samodolu dobu. Maugalumo, Nene Na, aufia Samodoyomo, Nene Na. Samini alolumo, Na lolu, Elosia miliyomo, Na lolu. Hano nabaife ilifeamo, Nahe miliyolu miliyo hano sugulofeafia udiaba holobagafemo, waagi ulu namenesi meyobasu. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2Sml 7.14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1Sto 17.13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:26-27">Sng 89.26-27</ref></char></note>Ausi, idele inolo abehe, dedeba besabi, yobolu kaamo adesenaga, amo ilihe kegele auba solu amo sunia, daalo diloguba diyobafe. Na-mo, ine Gode miliyo. Aufia ili-mo, ne faibili miliyobafe.<verse eid="REV 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:41">Mad 25.41</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:15">MUU 20.15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:15">22.15</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, idele inolo abehe sagilifia gigiliba adesia, fisaba anomoda, asigi ule ufuluale idele inolo amoda, asigi wolusu koleba ofolo amoda, idele inoloda dufa daneba ado amoda, susugu moloba ado amoda, gone moloba ado amoda, masega gode wi digiba selaba adoda, aufia idele inolo sunia masega sulu sodo amoda, idele inolo amogulumo, ine elebe haisi osolaba ufulu dobumo, waiyo usu, salofa de waiyaba labea ami dobu. Olalo aganebomo ewe.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yonehe Yelusalame hilimo abulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Ausi, sulu dia ano domoba amohe, higinilu gi-da fofalu disi domoba sesalifia alolu amone uleno, na labea inigia, eweguba seleso. “<char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi edo">Dofene Sibi Edofea</char> saaba melu ido, Efea ifoyobafemo, na gafea waleyoba, ga bea mila.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:2">Ese 40.2</ref></char></note>Auba safasiamo, Godene Asubane <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">Noekenemo</char> nafea adesia, kiwigaaba ofelesi, sulu dia anohe na luba dibia abiamo, hele gale bule ana labea ami goaso. Ani ana lagi ligia, ehe Yelusalame Sidi Noekene amo, <char style="w">hebene</char> Godefeafia suga saabe amo, nafea bamesi waleso. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:1-2">Ais 60.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 60:19">19</ref></char></note>Godene <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elalelumone</char> yanemo efea labi, sidi amo galagololu fofageba doweso. Abane <char style="it">yaseba</char>gulu, saeyo babealu, benabiye asigulubiyo.<verse eid="REV 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 48:30-35">Ese 48.30-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sidi amone yalalumo, ana fela daalubiyo. Yalaiya ami, enomo huguluba olaboba yaalubiyo. Aufia, sulu dia ano hugulubamo, eno olaboba waalelu ule uleba amone yasiba melesi, gadefaba yaalubiyo. <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu huguluba amone wimo, eno saliba ami seleba waalelubiyo. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Yalalu amofea, halo holobagalofealomo, eno saliba osoloa olabolubiyo. Aufia, halo hugalofealomoda, eno saliba osoloa olabolubiyo. Aufia, afafa nolobalo amimo, eno saliba osoloa olabolubiyo. Aufia, afafa nolobalo amida, eno saliba osoloa olabolubiyo. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Sidi amone yalamo, abane mololugulu, yala mau amone kolemesi, abane bule hugulubamo, ami diba waalebi, amone saabiamo, yala yalalabia daalubiyo. Abane bule huguluba amone saabiamo, Dofene Sibi Edone <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibaisi daalu</char> huguluba amone wimo, ami seleba waalelubiyo.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:3">Ese 40.3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:1">MUU 11.1</ref></char>
    </note>Sulu dia ano nadai sulu solu ewehe, sidida, sidi amone yalada, sidi amone eno salibada, iminiyone iminilo golo mololu i aafo amo selubiyo. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Sidi amone kulia biniba ufulu amo, imini ule ufulugulu iminisimo, fubada, isoda, imini ule aiba dobiyo. Sulu dia anohe, i aafo golo mololu amo sefia iminisimo, fubada, isoda, ana felaluda, alegalumo, imini ule aiba abiamo, 12,000<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Namba alegalu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">12,000</char><char style="ft" closed="false">amomo, mimisililune namba. Namba 12 amo ililiba samodolune alegalu namba iminife. Aufia, 1,000 amomo, wasigalune namba. Aulugulu, 12,000 iwi selefe amo namba wasigafia ililiba samodoluba iminife.</char></note> <char style="it">sedadia</char><note caller="†" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giligi suluba 12,000 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sedadia</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, 2,200 kilomidaba selefe. Amo Babua Niu Gini hele sunialu.</char></note> holobagalubiyo. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Yala amone gafinilumo iminisia alegalumo, 144<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Namba alegalu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">144</char><char style="ft" closed="false">amomo, mimisililune namba. Namba 12 amo ililiba samodolune alegalu namba iminife. Aufia, 12 saabia 12 alegafe amo 144 alegafe. Aulugulu, 144 iwi selefe amo, ililiba samodolu kolebaba iminife. (12 x 12 = 144). </char></note> <char style="it">kubidi</char><note caller="†" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giligi suluba 144 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kubidi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, 66 midaba selefe.</char></note> amogulu holobagalubiyo. Sulu dia ano iminisia alegasiamo, nini helefealu inolo iminisia alegaloguba alegaso. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:11-12">Ais 54.11-12</ref></char></note>Sidi amone fafa yala yalalumo, abane <char style="it">yaseba</char> yogolelu koleba amo difasia, yalalubiyo. Aufia, sidi amo <char style="w" lemma="Golo">golole</char> golo koleba amo difasia, mololugulu, galasigulu galagoloso. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Yalalu mau amone kolemesi abane bule huguluba waalebu amo, momadasiamo, abane yogolelune yogolelusu, saeyo babealu, amone saabia baalabia daalubiyo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 21:19" />
  <para style="li" vid="REV 21:19">Abane agelemo, yasebahe momadalumo, genelubiyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gahe abane yogolelu amone biimo babiyo hilisesenaga, figisa amo, degelalu 704-da,705-da, olofa ami dobu, bamale.</char></note></para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 21:19">Aganebomo, safaeahe momadalumo, imololubiyo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 21:19">Osolomo, agedehe momadalumo, imololugulubiyo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 21:19">Binibomo, emeladehe momadalumo, iwalugulubiyo.<verse eid="REV 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />Aufia, bimo, sadonikisihe momadalumo, heleguludai hooludaibiyo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 21:20">Kaabemo, konilianehe momadalumo, de isogulubiyo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 21:20">Aufia, domomo, kilisolaidihe momadalumo, galagololu iwalugulubiyo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 21:20">Aaiyomo, beliolohe momadalumo, galagololu waanogulubiyo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 21:20">Agofolomo, dofasehe momadalumo, imololugulu selegoalubiyo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 21:20">Aufia daabulumo, kilisofelesehe momadalumo, iwalugulubiyo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 21:20">Kilelemo, haiasinihe momadalumo, ibi genelugulubiyo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 21:20">Aufia afelesia, hugulumo, amedisihe momadalumo, hogalebiyo.<verse eid="REV 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Sidi amone eno saliba huguluba ule ulebamone, bage ule ulebahe mololabia daalubiyo. Aufia, sidi bule amone eno aiba feaba ufulumo, galasigulu galagolosia, golole golohe fealabia daalubiyo.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Auba aulugulu, nahe sidi amimo <char style="w">sebele molo</char> uleno labi abuluale. Mau enebamo, Kiwigagaluda suniane wasolumo, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Gode Edai, ene Dofene Sibi edo amodai, aalu waaga sidi amone sebele molo alolubiyo. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:19-20">Ais 60.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:5">MUU 22.5</ref></char></note>Godene elalelune yanehe sidi amofea neeba dowesi, Dofene sibi edo Ehe amone naafa neeba ofolo labene, halodai, aubedai, aalu neeyone dabalumo, ami malebiyo. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:3">Ais 60.3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 60:5">5</ref></char></note>Helefealu mosomu suniamo sidi amone yane usu ami daaba miliyobafe. Aufia, helefealu mosomu suniane kini amohe, ili sidi usu ami suga dedalefasia, ine beleme kegele ami diba waaleyobafe.<verse eid="REV 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 60:11">Ais 60.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sidi usu amimo, nigililo ami malegulu, ilihe sidi amone yalalu eno salibamo hilia ulenoda kaalale. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Aufia, helefealu idele inolo ilimo nafuluba momadafia, ine beleme kegele sidi usu ami dia suga dedaleyobafe. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Ais 52.1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 44:9">Ese 44.9</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:9-10">1Kld 6.9-10</ref></char></note>Auluso, kegele nugumaluda uleno, sidi usu ami dia sugaeyobafale. Aufia, kalemolu mana moloba labe uleno amoda, aufia, masega sodo uleno amoda, sidi usu ami sugaeyobafale koleba. Aubale. Idele inolo ine wimo, Dofene Sibi Edone Miliyolu Miliyo Bugohe wi seleba waalelu dobu, ili amosu ami suga dedaleyobafe.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s">Yonehe miliyolu miliyo hanodai, miliyolu miliyo idai, abulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 47:1">Ese 47.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, sulu dia ano ewehe hano bule uleno nafea waleso. Hano bule miliyolu miliyoda melo amo, elalelu galasigulu galagololubiyo. Hano amo Godedai, <char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi edo">Dofene Sibi Edodai</char>, aine asefalu ailaiya amifia sugulo dugulesia, udiafia, i soaba aaso. <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />Hano i soaba abia, sidi amone eno bule dobia olea amo soaba aaso. Aufia, hano amone egewi, nolobaloda, nolobaloda, miliyolu melo imo ami labeo. I amone sebemo, hamu sunia, aube ule uleba, helelebasu ligia, aube huguluba sunia aleba ami, gegenebasu adobiyo. Aufia, i amone walumo, mosomu suniane idele inolo waimesi gadefalubiyo.<verse eid="REV 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Ausi, amimo kanolo mana ulenoda haiba ufiyobafale. Godedai Dofene Sibi Edodai aine asefalu ailalumo, sidi usu ami ufia miliyobafe. Ausimo, ene dabalu mololo ilihe Efea guluguluba mesia, adaaba yaeyobafe. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:8">Mad 5.8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:12">MUU 3.12</ref></char></note>Ausi, ilihe Ene misi babiyobafe. Aufia, Ene wimo ine olegia seleba waaleba yaeyobafe. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:18">Dan 7.18</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:10">MUU 5.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:6">20.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:23">21.23</ref>, <ref loc="REV 21:25">25</ref></char></note>Ami haiba no nigiliyobafale. <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Gode Ene Ehe idele inolo ilifea ya neeba dowesi, ilihe naafa needa, halo needa, saabia no diyodoluale miliyobafe. Aufia, ili amo kini alebaisia, uluba ligia yasifia alefalu miliyobafe.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E alebale miyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 1:1">MUU 1.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sulu dia ano ewehe nafea eweguba seleso. “Sulu ewe seale eleda koleba. Idele inolo suniahe sulu ewefea koleba asigi ule ufiyodolu dobu. <char style="w">Saaba ofolo</char> ilihe Ene sulu samesi ine asubane degebada ofolo Gode, Saminilo amo Ehe, Ene sulu dia ano hilibaiso. Sulu dia ano amohe, Ene dabalu mololo inolofea kegele sunia alebale holobagaeyobafe, amone waleba samesi auso.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 1:3">MUU 1.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu selesia, “Bama! Na alebale solugo. Idele inolo ili abehe, saaba ofa sulu bugo ewehe selelu dobumoda fedoba sefe, ine henelomo wasigaabu.” E auba seleso.<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 19:10">MUU 19.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kegele bugo ewe seleba waalelu dobumo, abulumoda, dubulumoda, amo Yone, na. Na kegele amo dofasiada, bafasiada, sulu dia ano kegele eweda nafea walelu amofea, guluguluyone ene emo aniba sauba hanelu. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Auluso, ehe nafea selesia, “Ga auba molomabu. Nada, gadai, ge gelewodali saaba ofolo noolodai, gili galiba dabalu ua mololo lolu. Aufia, idele inolo sunia sulu eweda fedoba sefe ili amodai, na ili galibada dabalu ua mololomone lolu. Aulugulu, nafea gulugulumabiyo. Gahe Gode ulefeasu koleba guluguluba memale.”<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Aufia, ehe nafea gegoaba saabia no selesia, Oloba huliale sulu bugo ewehe selelu dobumo, ga muguba ofelesiale, adagilifia kaaba damabiyo. Mau enebamo, kegele bugo ewe usu seleba ufulu amo, Godehe moloyobafe amone fogomo mulu hagoale adefe. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:10">Dan 12.10</ref></char></note>Wolu mololo gili, aso wolu waagi mololabiasu dedaleba mela. Mana nugumalu mololo gili, aso nugumalu mana waagi mololabiasu dedaleba mela. Isolu mana molosia waalelu gili, aso isolu mana waagi mololabiasu dedaleba melale. <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu melesi moloba ofolo">Godene muuba kalilu noekene moloba waalelu</char> gili, Godehe gili aso muuba kalilu noekene waagi mololabiasu dedaleba melesi, melale.<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:10">Ais 40.10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Jer 17.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:23">MUU 2.23</ref></char>
    </note>Yesu selesia, “Bama! Na alebale solugo. Nahe idele inolo suniafea mana elebi elebiba mololu amoguba sabe meyo elebe sefia solugo. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">Ais 44.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:8">MUU 1.8</ref>, <ref loc="REV 1:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:6">21.6</ref></char></note>Maugalumo, Nene Na, aufia Samodoyomo, Nene Na lolu. Leda <char style="it">A,</char> Nene Na lolu. Leda <char style="it">Ya,</char> Nene Na lolu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">A</char><char style="ft" closed="false">-mo Onobasulu selelo amone maugalo. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ya</char><char style="ft" closed="false">-mo, Onobasulu selelo amone elolo. Baibolo noolomo ga sulu ewe babiyobafe: <char style="it">Alefa</char>da <char style="it">Omega</char>da. Alefaba selefe amo, Giligi sulu selelo amone maugalo. Aufia, Omegaba selefe amo, Giligi sulu selelo amone elolo.</char></note> Samini alolumo, Na lolu, Elosia miliyomo, Na lolu.<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:9">Stt 2.9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:22">3.22</ref></char>
    </note>Idele inolo ine faguloda heesia alebaibumo, ine henelo wasigafia labe. Mau enebamo, ili amofea, sidi amone eno saliba waalebu amo, waagi suga dedalemayobafe. Aufia, ilifea miliyolu miliyo i sebe amo waagi namenayobafe. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Auluso, sidi amone yala faisa alebaibumo, ewe. Gone mololoda, susugu mololoda, inolo dufa olaloda, masega godefea gulugululoda, masega gegelo mana hameloda, gegelo mana mololo ilida, ili geso nugumalugulu labene, ili baea alebaiyobafe.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 24:17">Nam 24.17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Ais 11.1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 11:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:3">Lom 1.3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:28">MUU 2.28</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:5">5.5</ref></char>
    </note>Na Yesu, Nahe Ne <char style="w">sulu dia ano</char> gili labea hilibailu. Ehe gilifea sulu ewe saaba mesi, gilihe <char style="w">sese</char> adaaba yaabufea sulu ewe samesi hilibailu. Kini <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> saladegelu amifia baii holobagaeyobafeba solumo, amo Na. Aufia, Na-mo, sigabi keafa bule neelomo, Waale amomo, Na.”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:1">Ais 55.1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:6">MUU 21.6</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenedai</char>, Dofene Sibi Edofea ido ifoyomodai, aalu selesia, “Ga mila-aaa!” Aufia, sulu eweda dobelefe amo gada, “Milaba” saama. “Dogaeyoda falafe ga, mila! Hanoda nabaife ga, miliyolu miliyo hano ulu naiyone mila!”<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Yone nahe, bugo ewene saaba ofa sulu soluda dobelefe gili suniafea, sulu eweguba haguguba selesu. Uleno abehe, sulu ewefea sulu haisi uleno gegoaba ofelesenaga, amo Gode alefasia, bugo ewehe higinilu gi selelu dobumo, efea gegoaba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Aufia, uleno abehe, bugo ewehe saaba ofa sulu selelu dobu amone sulu haisi uleno diba dafelesenaga, amo Gode alefasia, bugo ewehe kegele nafulu selelu dobumo, efea diba dafiyobafe. Ausia, miliyolu miliyo i amofeafia e sumesi, haisi ene-ba osolaba ufulumo, Godehe diba dafiyobafe. Aufia, e sidi noekene ami mesesi, ene-ba madeneba ufulumo, Godehe diba dafiyobafe.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:30-31">Mad 24.30-31</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 16:22">1Kld 16.22</ref></char>
    </note>Inolo kegele ewe suniada ulufaba saaba dafelagofe ewe Ehe, aga selesia, “Ee, Na alebale solugo.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 22:20">
    <char style="sls">
      <char style="w">Amen</char>!</char> Amo seale koleba. Saminilo Yesu, Ga mila!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Saminilo Yesune <char style="w">kanululo</char> amo idele inolo suniadai miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:21">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasuluRevelationGreen.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="22.21" /><verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>